`Chat.type` 精确判私聊 / 群 / 频道；缓存没有时才退回\n按 `chat_id` 正负粗略判。"},"1114":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#hidden","content":"`hidden = true` 只是**不进 `/help`**，不是授权："},"1115":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#hidden","content":"命令仍在能力表里，`role` / `scopes` 照常生效；"},"1116":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#hidden","content":"适合兼容命令、彩蛋、只给程序调用的命令。"},"1117":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#help-怎么拿到列表","content":"`/help` 调宿主的 `list` 方法："},"1118":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#help-怎么拿到列表","content":"`list` 返回**未过滤**的扁平数组："},"1119":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#help-怎么拿到列表","content":"然后 `/help` 在自己的回复线程里："},"1120":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#help-怎么拿到列表","content":"调 `role` 拿当前用户的全局角色；"},"1121":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#help-怎么拿到列表","content":"从对象缓存拿会话类型 / 本会话管理员身份；"},"1122":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#help-怎么拿到列表","content":"过滤 `hidden`、`role`、`scopes`；"},"1123":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#help-怎么拿到列表","content":"按 `plugin` 分组，组标题用宿主报告里的 `display_name`，没有就退回短名。"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#help-怎么拿到列表","content":"> `list` 是原始表；按人和会话过滤后的“可见命令列表”目前只在 `/help` 内部计算，\n> 没有单独的 service 方法。别的插件要复用同一份过滤逻辑时，建议在宿主加一个\n> `visible` 方法，而不是自己再拼一遍角色判断。"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#旧版怎么工作","content":"`/help` 插件自己持有一个 `REGISTRY`；"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#旧版怎么工作","content":"其它插件调 `fuyubot.help.commands` 的 `register`；"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#旧版怎么工作","content":"`start` / `manage` 声明 `soft_inject = [\"fuyubot.help.commands\"]`，等 help 先起来；"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#旧版怎么工作","content":"`/help` 直接读自己的注册表，再和 `BUILTIN_COMMANDS` 静态兜底合并。"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#要改什么","content":"| 旧                       | 新                       |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `fuyubot.help.commands` | `fuyubot.host.commands` |","table":"table-3"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#要改什么","content":"| 旧                                         | 新            |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ------------ |\n| `soft_inject = [\"fuyubot.help.commands\"]` | 删除；宿主服务启动时就在 |","table":"table-3"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#要改什么","content":"| 旧                            | 新                                          |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `{\"name\":…,\"description\":…}` | 可继续只传这两个，`role` / `scopes` / `hidden` 用默认值 |","table":"table-3"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#要改什么","content":"| 旧                 | 新                         |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------- |\n| help 插件卸载 = 命令表消失 | 命令表在宿主；只有登记它的插件卸载才会摘掉它的条目 |","table":"table-3"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#要改什么","content":"| 旧           | 新              |\n| ----------- | -------------- |\n| 插件卸载后条目可能残留 | 宿主按 owner 整批回滚 |","table":"table-3"},"1134":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#要改什么","content":"旧插件不改也能跑：`fuyubot.help.commands` 是宿主的别名，登记进同一张表。\n但它只是一个版本的兼容层，新代码请直接用 `fuyubot.host.commands`。"},"1135":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#行为变化","content":"**同名冲突**：以前后登记的会覆盖/并存得不明确；现在跨插件同名会被拒绝。\n如果两个插件用了同一个命令名，改名或只保留一个。"},"1136":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#行为变化","content":"**卸载即消失**：插件卸载 / 加载失败，它登记的命令自动从 `/help` 和能力表里消失。"},"1137":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#行为变化","content":"**默认角色**：旧登记没有 `role`，按 `user`；没有 `scopes`，按 `private + group`。"},"1138":{"id":"/docs/plugin/command-table-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/command-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/command-table#行为变化","content":"**主人 / 管理员命令默认只进私聊**：要群里用，显式写 `s