兜底-update","content":"六阶段，实跑 4 个"},"1169":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"PreUpdate"},"1170":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"0 · 刚进来"},"1171":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"PreRoute"},"1172":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"1 · 解析 @type"},"1173":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"InPlugin"},"1174":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"2 · 可改负载"},"1175":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"PostResponse"},"1176":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"3 · 收尾"},"1177":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"中间件挂在阶段上；一条更新只跑一遍，不是每个监听器一遍"},"1178":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"同时发两条"},"1179":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"具体 @type 通道"},"1180":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"updateNewMessage、……"},"1181":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"兜底 update 通道"},"1182":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"每条更新都发一份"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"插件 A"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"精确订阅 updateNewMessage"},"1185":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"插件 B"},"1186":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"订阅兜底 update，或带过滤器"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"**两条通道是「同时」，不是「二选一」**：一条 `updateNewMessage` 既会敲精确订阅它的监听器，也会敲所有\n订阅了 `\"update\"` 的监听器。过滤器在两个通道上各判一次，所以订阅兜底又写了过滤器的那一侧不会因为\n「没命中精确通道」而漏掉。"},"1188":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"例外：**命令被闸门拦下**时，宿主只发 `\"update\"` 兜底通道，不发 `updateNewMessage`。\n这样 `on_command` 不会响应，但自己订阅 `\"update\"` 的原始更新监听器照样能看见。\n典型场景：user 账户的 `/xxx`（改用 `[command].prefix` 里的命令头，默认 `.`）\n与非白名单用户发来的命令。"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"`on` 的第三个参数是一份过滤器 JSON：**点分路径 → 期望值**。"},"1190":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则                       | 说明                                                                |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `event_type` 键只用来**选通道** | `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":5}` 表示等 5 号响应；它**不参与负载匹配** |","table":"table-1"},"1191":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则           | 说明                                                            |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 其余键做负载字段相等匹配 | 字段位置随更新类型变：`updateNewMessage` 的 `chat_id` 在 `message.chat_id` |","table":"table-1"},"1192":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则              | 说明    |\n| --------------- | ----- |\n| 空 / `null` / 不传 | 该通道全收 |","table":"table-1"},"1193":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"同一个事件可以订阅**多次**、各带各的过滤器。脚本侧按订阅号 `handle` 分发，所以不该响的回调不会响。"},"1194":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"插件里调 `emit` 走的是 `emit_scoped(自己, …)`：只送给**该插件自己 + 全局订阅者**。\n归属的语义是「**额外定向**」而不是「排除广播」——宿主 `emit` 的更新照旧发给所有订阅者，\n`emit_scoped(owner, …)` 只是在那份收件人之外**再加**上 `owner` 自己的订阅。"},"1195":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发             | 谁收得到     |\n| -------------- | -------- |\n| 宿主发更新 / `emit` | 所有匹配的订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"1196":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发                | 谁收得到              |\n| ----------------- | ----------------- |\n| 插件 `emit(\"x\", …)` | 该插件自己的订阅者 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"1197":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发    | 谁收得到                                       |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 宿主的响应 | `emit_scoped(发起者, \"response\", …)`：全局 + 发起者 |","table":"table-2"},"1198":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"要让别的插件收到你的事件，**让对方订阅全局事件**，不要指望你的 `emit` 是一次广播。"},"1199":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"订阅句柄不会自动退订。`HostApi::on` 返回的是 `SubscriptionHandle`（一个 `u64`），\ndrop 它什么也不会发生；要提前退订就自己留住句柄并调 `host.off(handle)`。\n插件卸载时宿主会整批回滚。"},"1200":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#rust","content":"回调用 `extern \"C-unwind\" fn(user_data, payload: *const c_char) -> i32`，返回 `0` 表示成功；\n`payload` 是宿主临时的 NUL 结尾字符串，要留就当场拷走（`serde_json::from_str` 解析）。"},"1201":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#脚本插件","content":"脚本侧的事件模型与此完全相同（同样的通道、同样的点分过滤），只是入口换成了薄 SDK\n的 `on(event, handler, filter)`。那一套不在本板块：见脚本插件。"},"1202":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#脚本插件","content":"要按固定次数等一条更新（阻塞式），用 `wait_for_update`，见 调用 TDLib。\n要改流经管线的负载，用中间件，见 工具与中间件。"},"1203":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"page","content":"外部仓库插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external"},"1204":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external","content":"不进本体 workspace 的原生插件，怎么接依赖、怎么拿插件目录"},"1205":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"依赖：只能走 path"},"1206":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"插件目录：别自己算"},"1207":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#线程回调里不能做慢事","content":"线程：回调里不能做慢事"},"1208":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#装与验","content":"装与验"},"1209":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#一个真实例子","content":"一个真实例子"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"下一步"},"1211":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external","content":"内置插件（`/start`、`/help`、`/plugins`）跟着发布包走，**第三方插件不必**：\n它们自己一个仓库、`cargo build` 出一个 cdylib，用 `fuyubot plugin install` 装进项目。"},"1212":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external","content":"形态和内置插件完全一样（同一个 `define_plugin!`、同一张 `HostApiVTable`），\n差别只在三件事：**依赖怎么接**、**插件目录在哪**、**运行时库能不能从 crates.io 拿**。"},"1213":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"运行时仓库只往 crates.io 发两个 crate：`fuyubot-abi` 和 `fuyubot-tdlib-sys`。\n**`fuyubot-simplify` 是 `publish = false`**——它不在 crates.io 上。"},"1214":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"把它写成 `fuyubot-simplify = \"0.1\"` 会**编不过**（crates.io 上没有这个版本）。\n等它发版之后换成一行版本号就行。"},"1215":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"`fuyubot-simplify` 在这里只当「人话参数 → TDLib 请求体」的构造器库用：\n`SendMessageParams` / `Media` / `Text` / `send_params` / `album_params` / `edit_*_params`。\n「发出去并等结局」那一步走 ABI v5 的 op JSON 分发——\n和 Python / JS / Go 插件同一条路。"},"1216":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"插件是宿主进程 `dlopen` 出来的动态库，`std::env::current_exe()` 拿到的是 **`fuyubot.exe`**，\n不是插件自己的目录——插件算不出自己旁边有什么文件。"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"要读同目录的静态资源（cookie、词表、模板），让宿主告诉你：\n`plugin_start` 的 `config_json` 里带着 `plugins_dir`（绝对路径）。"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"内置 `manage` 插件就是这么写的，可以照抄。"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#线程回调里不能做慢事","content":"`updateNewMessage` 的回调跑在**宿主的接收循环线程**上。解析网页、调外部 API、\n等 TDLib 应答——任何一件在这里同步做，都会把整个宿主堵死（同进程所有插件一起卡）。"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#线程回调里不能做慢事","content":"⚠️ 那个 `JoinHandle` **必须存进插件状态并在 `stop()` 里 join 掉**：\n宿主卸载动态库之后，线程还在跑库里的代码就是**未定义行为**。"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#装与验","content":"`--replay-wait` 给插件的静默窗口：要发慢速网络请求时调大，否则进程可能在请求发出前就退了\n（默认原生插件只有 150 ms）。见 离线回放。"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#一个真实例子","content":"FuyuBot-Douyin——抖音解析插件，\n`/dy <链接>` + 消息里自动识别抖音链接。它演示了本文全部三件事：\npath 依赖、靠 `plugins_dir` 读 cookie、回调里 spawn 工作线程。"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#一个真实例子","content":"同类做法另见 `XQAnimeBot-Rust`（把 MongoDB / qBittorrent / ffmpeg 各自拆成一个插件，\n业务插件按服务名取用）。"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"Rust 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rust/\" />"},"1225":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"ABI 契约\" href=\"/docs/plugin/abi/\" />"},"1226":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"离线回放\" href=\"/docs/usage/replay/\" />"},"1227":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"page","content":"Go 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go"},"1228":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"cgo 编 c-shared，逻辑用 Go 写、ABI 用一层 C 薄壳"},"1229":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#头文件","content":"头文件"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#落盘一个只负责生成头文件的小-crate","content":"落盘：一个只负责生成头文件的小 crate"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#让-cgo-找到它","content":"让 cgo 找到它"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#别提交别手改","content":"别提交、别手改"},"1233":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"结构：Go 写逻辑，C 写壳"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"常用 ABI 怎么调：在 `plugin.c` 里加桥"},"1235":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"编译"},"1237":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"一个宿主行为要记住：Go 库不会被卸载"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#验证","content":"验证"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"相关"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"Go 也能写插件：`go build -buildmode=c-shared` 出来的就是标准动态库，宿主只要看到七个导出符号\n就认它。Go 这条路线没有脚手架——照本页的结构自己搭，ABI 头文件从 `fuyubot-abi` 落盘\n（见 C 与 C++ 插件 › 头文件）。"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"Go 没有脚手架模板，也没有官方的 `go-ping` 示例——照下面这几段自己搭工程。\nC 头文件仍然由 `fuyubot-abi` 生成，两门语言共用同一份，不要手抄。"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"用 AI Agent 写？本站导出了 `llms.txt` / `llms-full.txt` 和每页的 `content.md`，\n怎么喂见插件总览 › 用 AI Agent 写插件。"},"1243":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#头文件","content":"Go 这条路线同样要先落地 `fuyubot_plugin.h`：它是 `fuyubot-abi` 构建时用 cbindgen 从 Rust 定义生成的产物，\n**仓库里没有、也不要提交**，C / C++ / Go 三份代码认的是同一份（来源与另两条拿法见\nC 与 C++ 插件 › 头文件）。下面是 Go 工程的落地方式。"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#落盘一个只负责生成头文件的小-crate","content":"Go 工程里没有 `Cargo.toml`，所以造一个只为落头文件的 crate（`header-gen` 这个名字随意）："},"1245":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#落盘一个只负责生成头文件的小-crate","content":"`cargo new` 带的那个空 `src/lib.rs` 留着就行——它只是让 manifest 有个 target，\n这个 crate 永远不会被编进插件，Go 侧也不需要它。"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#落盘一个只负责生成头文件的小-crate","content":"手头已经有 `fuyubot` 源码、或者别的 C/C++ 工程已经落过一份？直接从构建产物里拷更快\n（`<hash>` 每次构建都变，所以按时间取最新，别抄死路径）："},"1247":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#让-cgo-找到它","content":"放在 Go 工程根、与 `plugin.c` 同级最省事：cgo 编 `.c` 时引号包含**先查源文件目录**，\n`#include \"fuyubot_plugin.h\"` 直接就生效，`CGO_CFLAGS` 一个字都不用加："},"1248":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#让-cgo-找到它","content":"放进 `include/` 之类的子目录才需要指路，而 `#cgo` 指令**只能写在 `.go` 文件的 preamble 里**\n（写在 `.c` 里 cgo 不认）："},"1249":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#让-cgo-找到它","content":"`go build` 报 `fatal error: fuyubot_plugin.h: No such file or directory`，就是这一步没做。"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#别提交别手改","content":"生成物进 `.gitignore`：`echo \"fuyubot_plugin.h\" >> .gitignore`；"},"1251":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#别提交别手改","content":"头文件里的 `#define ABI_VERSION 6` 必须与你机器上的 `fuyubot` 一致，升级宿主后重跑一次生成；"},"1252":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#别提交别手改","content":"改 ABI 只能改 `fuyubot-abi` 的 Rust 定义——头文件是产物，手改会被下次生成覆盖，\n而且版本号对不上时宿主会直接拒绝加载。"},"1253":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件        | 作用                               |\n| --------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `main.go` | 逻辑：解析更新 JSON、拼 `sendMessage`、打日志 |","table":"table-0"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件         | 作用                                                                              |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin.c` | 四个 ABI 符号：`plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_free_string` |","table":"table-0"},"1255":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件                 | 作用                                                        |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_plugin.h` | 生成物（由 `fuyubot-abi` 的 `PLUGIN_HEADER` 落盘），**不提交**；怎么拿到见上文 |","table":"table-0"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"为什么不直接 `//export plugin_init`：`PluginHandle` 是**按值返回**的结构体，由 C 侧构造最稳；\n也避免把宿主 VTable 的函数指针搬进 Go。C 侧只做转发："},"1257":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"Go 侧通过两个 C 小桥访问宿主（这样 Go 里不用碰函数指针）："},"1258":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"`fy_log` / `fy_invoke` 在 `plugin.c` 里实现，就是 `g_host->log` / `g_host->td_invoke_simplified` 的转发。"},"1259":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"本页的 `plugin.c` 只带了两个桥（`fy_log` / `fy_invoke`）。要用别的 ABI 函数就照同样形状加——\n**每个桥一行转发**，Go 侧不碰函数指针："},"1260":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"Go 侧声明 + 包一层："},"1261":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"三条 cgo 侧的硬规则："},"1262":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"传给 C 的字符串用 `C.CString` + `defer C.free`；漏了就是泄漏。"},"1263":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"桥返回的 `const char *` 是**宿主缓冲**：`C.GoString` 立刻拷贝，**不要**把 `*C.char` 存下来，\n也**不要** free 它。"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"订阅句柄留在 C 侧（`plugin_start` 里 `g_host->on(...)` 存进静态变量），Go 侧不持有——\ndrop 即退订，交到 Go 手里容易漏。"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> Go 没有脚手架（见页首），但可以直接调 VTable 上的\n> `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result`（见下），或者照下面手写 `invoke(sendMessage, …)`。"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"先来一个能跑的：在 `plugin.c` 里加一座 `simplify_invoke` 桥（和 `fy_invoke` 同形状），Go 侧就能像\n调普通函数一样发 op——宿主替你解析文本、等到真发出去、超时先撤回；结果经已有的 `\"response\"`\n通道回投（带 `request_id`，与 `fy_invoke` 的响应同一个 `on` 通道）："},"1267":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `invoke(\"sendMessage\", …)` 是**另一条路**——下面这些字段你都得自己拼对："},"1268":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                               |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，`text` 是 `formattedText` |","table":"table-1"},"1269":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                  |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Markdown / HTML | 先 `fy_execute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2），把返回的 `formattedText` 塞进去 |","table":"table-1"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"1271":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                            |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"1272":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                     |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；callback 的 `data` 是 **base64** |","table":"table-1"},"1273":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                      |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | 请求号只到**临时消息**；要最终 `Message` 得再等 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-1"},"1274":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"方法名与字段名以 `td_api.tl` 为准（见调用 TDLib）。"},"1275":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"cgo 需要 C 编译器：Linux / macOS 用 `cc`，Windows 用 mingw-w64（如\nw64devkit）。"},"1276":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"头文件按上文「头文件」落好之后，直接编："},"1277":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"Windows 上没装 mingw 时报 `gcc: executable file not found` 或\n`cannot open file 'mingwex.lib'`——那是缺 C 工具链，不是插件代码的问题。\nMSVC 的 `cl` 不能直接给 cgo 用（Go 的 Windows 外部链接器要 GCC 那一套）。"},"1278":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"Go 的 `c-shared` 运行时有线程与信号处理器，`FreeLibrary` / `dlclose` 之后进程会直接\naccess violation（`0xC0000005`）。"},"1279":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"所以 `fuyubot-loader` 会识别 Go 产物（文件里的 `\\xff Go buildinf:` 魔数），\n**故意不卸载**这类库：`plugin_stop` 照跑、注册照回滚，只是那几 MB 库内存留到进程退出。\n普通 Rust / C / C++ 插件不受影响，仍是 drop 即卸载。"},"1280":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"这也意味着：**别在同一个进程里反复加载同一个 Go 插件**（热重载路径别指望它）。\n先 `fuyubot stop` 再 `run`，行为是干净的。"},"1281":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#验证","content":"回放输出里应能看到 `go-ping 插件：回了 pong` 和一条\n`sendMessage {\"chat_id\":…,\"input_message_content\":{\"@type\":\"inputMessageText\",…}}`。"},"1282":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"ABI 细节（2 个 u32 + `host_ctx` + 27 个函数指针、内存所有权、版本协商）：ABI 契约"},"1283":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"C / C++ 的写法（同一份头文件）：C 与 C++ 插件"},"1284":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"订阅与过滤器：订阅与事件"},"1285":{"id":"/docs/plugin","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"page","content":"插件总览","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin"},"1286":{"id":"/docs/plugin-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"一个 cdylib = 一个插件：七个导出符号、依赖声明与最小闭环"},"1287":{"id":"/docs/plugin-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#用-ai-agent-写插件","content":"用 AI Agent 写插件"},"1288":{"id":"/docs/plugin-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#怎么喂","content":"怎么喂"},"1289":{"id":"/docs/plugin-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#让它别编","content":"让它别编"},"1290":{"id":"/docs/plugin-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#让它自证","content":"让它自证"},"1291":{"id":"/docs/plugin-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"原生插件：七个导出符号"},"1292":{"id":"/docs/plugin-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"最小闭环（原生插件）"},"1293":{"id":"/docs/plugin-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的七件事","content":"写原生插件要知道的七件事"},"1294":{"id":"/docs/plugin-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"声明依赖：`inject` 与 `soft_inject`"},"1295":{"id":"/docs/plugin-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"按语言看"},"1296":{"id":"/docs/plugin-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"按能力看"},"1297":{"id":"/docs/plugin-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"插件名与目录"},"1298":{"id":"/docs/plugin-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"本板块只讲**原生插件**：一个 cdylib（`.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`）就是一个插件，\n用 Rust / C / C++ / Go 写，直接和宿主同进程跑 C ABI。"},"1299":{"id":"/docs/plugin-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"**只想写脚本？** Python / JS / TS 不走这条路。脚本能力完全由独立的\n`fuyubot.script` 插件提供，见脚本插件：一个目录就是一个插件，\n不编译、不碰 ABI，装上就跑。"},"1300":{"id":"/docs/plugin-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#用-ai-agent-写插件","content":"本站导出了机器可读版本，Agent 不用抓 HTML、也不会被导航和样式淹没。\n**推荐让 Agent 先读这几页再动手**，而不是凭印象拼 ABI 调用："},"1301":{"id":"/docs/plugin-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#用-ai-agent-写插件","content":"| 要什么                  | 地址                                                     | 体量       |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | -------- |\n| 全站目录：每页标题 + 一句话 + 链接 | `https://catmoecircle.github.io/FuyuBot-docs/llms.txt` | 约 4.6 KB |","table":"table-0"},"1302":{"id":"/docs/plugin-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#用-ai-agent-写插件","content":"| 要什么                      | 地址                                                          | 体量       |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------- | -------- |\n| 全站正文：所有页面的 Markdown 拼在一起 | `https://catmoecircle.github.io/FuyuBot-docs/llms-full.txt` | 约 430 KB |","table":"table-0"},"1303":{"id":"/docs/plugin-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#用-ai-agent-写插件","content":"| 要什么                                 | 地址                                                                                | 体量   |\n| ----------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---- |\n| 单页原文（`Content-Type: text/markdown`） | `https://catmoecircle.github.io/FuyuBot-docs/llms.mdx/docs/plugin/abi/content.md` | 几 KB |","table":"table-0"},"1304":{"id":"/docs/plugin-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#用-ai-agent-写插件","content":"| 要什么  | 地址                                                                            | 体量  |\n| ---- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- |\n| 本页原文 | `https://catmoecircle.github.io/FuyuBot-docs/llms.mdx/docs/plugin/content.md` |     |","table":"table-0"},"1305":{"id":"/docs/plugin-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#用-ai-agent-写插件","content":"单页地址就是把文档路径接在 `/llms.mdx/docs/` 后面再补 `content.md`（`/docs/plugin/go` →\n`/llms.mdx/docs/plugin/go/content.md`）。"},"1306":{"id":"/docs/plugin-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#用-ai-agent-写插件","content":"**两种 Markdown 里的链接都不是能直接请求的绝对地址**，提前跟 Agent 讲清楚，否则它会撞一堆 404："},"1307":{"id":"/docs/plugin-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#用-ai-agent-写插件","content":"`llms.txt` / `llms-full.txt` 的页头是 `/docs/plugin/...`，站点**根路径**，要拼上\n`https://catmoecircle.github.io/FuyuBot-docs` 才是真实 URL；"},"1308":{"id":"/docs/plugin-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#用-ai-agent-写插件","content":"正文里保留着 `./native.mdx#头文件` 这种**相对源文件**的写法（单页 `content.md` 同理），\n要按「同一目录」解析，别原样去请求。"},"1309":{"id":"/docs/plugin-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#用-ai-agent-写插件","content":"正文里还会看到 `<Callout>` 这类 MDX 组件标签，当提示框读就行，不影响内容。"},"1310":{"id":"/docs/plugin-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#怎么喂","content":"**只写一个插件**：别整份塞。先给 `llms.txt` 让它知道有哪些页，再按语言喂几篇——\nRust 是 `rust` + `abi` + `testing`；C / C++ 是 `native` + `abi` + `testing`；\nGo 是 `go` + `native` + `abi`。"},"1311":{"id":"/docs/plugin-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#怎么喂","content":"**要它通读全站**：`llms-full.txt` 有 40 多万字节，先看模型的上下文窗口再决定。"},"1312":{"id":"/docs/plugin-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#怎么喂","content":"**改到一半追问细节**：让它直接拉对应页的 `content.md`，比它复述你的摘要可靠。"},"1313":{"id":"/docs/plugin-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#让它别编","content":"Agent 最容易在 ABI 上想当然。把这几条写进提示词："},"1314":{"id":"/docs/plugin-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#让它别编","content":"ABI 是 **v6**：`HostApiVTable::version` 必须等于头文件里的 `#define ABI_VERSION 6`，不匹配宿主直接拒绝加载；"},"1315":{"id":"/docs/plugin-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#让它别编","content":"七个导出符号里 `plugin_init` / `plugin_free_string` 是**必需**的，其余可选；"},"1316":{"id":"/docs/plugin-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#让它别编","content":"回调是 `extern \"C-unwind\"`（Rust 侧）；C++ 里异常**不许**穿过这个边界；"},"1317":{"id":"/docs/plugin-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#让它别编","content":"回命令不要自己拼 `sendMessage`：Rust 用 `Command::reply_then`，其它语言走 `simplify_invoke`\n或 `fuyubot.host.command` 服务；"},"1318":{"id":"/docs/plugin-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#让它别编","content":"字符串所有权：宿主返回的是**线程局部缓冲**，读完即弃、**不要 free**；插件自己分配的只能自己用\n`plugin_free_string` 还。"},"1319":{"id":"/docs/plugin-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#让它自证","content":"Agent 说「编过了」不等于能加载。收尾要求它跑一遍离线回放（不接账号、不连 TDLib）："},"1320":{"id":"/docs/plugin-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#让它自证","content":"输出里能看到插件打的日志和它发出去的请求，比「看起来对」可信——细节见调试与安装。"},"1321":{"id":"/docs/plugin-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"一个原生插件 = 一个 cdylib。宿主 `dlopen` 它，只认这七个导出符号，\n其余全部能力都经 `HostApiVTable` 回调宿主。插件不认识 Rust 内核，也不需要认识。"},"1322":{"id":"/docs/plugin-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 干什么                                               |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 校验 VTable、构造插件状态；返回失败句柄（`abi_version == 0`）= 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-1"},"1323":{"id":"/docs/plugin-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 干什么                       |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 拿到配置 JSON，注册订阅 / 工具 / 中间件 |","table":"table-1"},"1324":{"id":"/docs/plugin-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 干什么            |\n| ------------- | --- | -------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 卸载前调一次，回收自己的状态 |","table":"table-1"},"1325":{"id":"/docs/plugin-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 干什么                               |\n| -------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 释放**插件自己**分配的字符串（宿主从不 free 插件的指针） |","table":"table-1"},"1326":{"id":"/docs/plugin-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                | 必须吗   | 干什么                                                                              |\n| ----------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | v4 可选 | 返回自描述 JSON（名字 / 版本 / `inject` / `soft_inject`）。宿主在 `plugin_init` **之前**读它来决定激活顺序 |","table":"table-1"},"1327":{"id":"/docs/plugin-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                    | 必须吗   | 干什么                                  |\n| --------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | v4 可选 | 静态返回编译期 `ABI_VERSION`；静态检查工具不加载也能看到它 |","table":"table-1"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/plugin-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗   | 干什么                                                         |\n| -------------------- | ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | v4 可选 | 只在 ABI 版本不匹配时被调——那一刻不能调 `plugin_stop`，只能用它把 `init` 分配的状态还回来 |","table":"table-1"},"1329":{"id":"/docs/plugin-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"契约细节（字段布局、内存所有权、版本协商、服务作用域）见 ABI 契约。"},"1330":{"id":"/docs/plugin-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"最小可跑的 Rust 插件全文见 Rust 插件；C / C++ / Go 见各自页面。"},"1331":{"id":"/docs/plugin-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"`fuyubot init` 重复执行会被挡住（不覆盖你改过的配置）；三个键都有默认值，最简可以只有 `[bot]`。"},"1332":{"id":"/docs/plugin-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"插件名只允许字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`（会拼进源码与 TOML）；目录名里的 `.` / `-` 换成 `_` 当 crate 名\n（`fuyubot.weather` → `fuyubot_weather`）。"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/plugin-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"**产物落在哪**：`plugin install <工程目录>` 按 `<工程>/target/{release,debug}` → 工程目录本身 →\n**沿父链最近的** `target/{release,debug}` 找产物（两边都有时取较新的）。插件若是**当前 workspace 的成员**，\n`cargo build -p <crate>` 默认把产物放在仓库根的 `target/`，靠最后一档照样能找到，不需要额外参数。"},"1334":{"id":"/docs/plugin-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"`fuyubot` 不编译、也不打包插件：编译是作者自己语言工具链的事\n（`cargo build` / `cl /LD` / `gcc -shared`）。`fuyubot plugin install` 只**复制**已编好的产物。"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/plugin-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的七件事","content":"| 事                       | 说明                                                              |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回调是 `extern \"C-unwind\"` | 用 `extern \"C\"` 的话，逃出去的 panic 直接 abort 整个进程，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind` |","table":"table-2"},"1336":{"id":"/docs/plugin-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的七件事","content":"| 事                               | 说明                        |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 一个 crate 只展开一次 `define_plugin!` | 七个符号名是 ABI 定死的，展开两次就是重复定义 |","table":"table-2"},"1337":{"id":"/docs/plugin-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的七件事","content":"| 事             | 说明                                                               |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| ABI 版本目前是 `6` | 不匹配时宿主**拒绝加载**，不能调 `plugin_stop`，但会调 `plugin_free_handle` 把状态还回来 |","table":"table-2"},"1338":{"id":"/docs/plugin-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的七件事","content":"| 事        | 说明                                                                             |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 订阅句柄要自己管 | `HostApi::on` 返回 `SubscriptionHandle`（`u64`），drop 不会退订；要退订就 `host.off(handle)` |","table":"table-2"},"1339":{"id":"/docs/plugin-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的七件事","content":"| 事              | 说明                                         |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 插件 `emit` 不是广播 | 只送**自己 + 全局订阅者**（`emit_scoped`），影响别的插件要靠订阅 |","table":"table-2"},"1340":{"id":"/docs/plugin-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的七件事","content":"| 事      | 说明                                       |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 谁分配谁释放 | 宿主绝不 free 插件的指针；宿主给的字符串是线程局部缓冲，下次宿主调用前有效 |","table":"table-2"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/plugin-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的七件事","content":"| 事       | 说明                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 命令回复走宿主 | 用 `Command::reply` / `reply_then`（其它语言走 `fuyubot.host.command` service），不要自己拼 `sendMessage`；宿主决定发新消息还是编辑原命令消息，返回最终 `Message`。`reply` 阻塞，回调里必须用 `reply_then`。命令带 `ephemeral_message_id` 且是 bot、非私聊时自动走 `sendEphemeralMessage` |","table":"table-2"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/plugin-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"manifest 里能声明两个列表，它们决定**宿主什么时候让你跑**、以及**跑的顺序**："},"1343":{"id":"/docs/plugin-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"| 字段       | 意思  | 缺了会怎样                            |\n| -------- | --- | -------------------------------- |\n| `inject` | 硬依赖 | **不激活**。停在 `Pending` 等着，等你缺的东西出现 |","table":"table-3"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/plugin-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"| 字段            | 意思  | 缺了会怎样                  |\n| ------------- | --- | ---------------------- |\n| `soft_inject` | 软依赖 | 照常激活，只是排在「软依赖也齐了」的插件后面 |","table":"table-3"},"1345":{"id":"/docs/plugin-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"依赖名可以写两种东西，宿主都认："},"1346":{"id":"/docs/plugin-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**服务名** —— 比如 `\"storage.mongo\"`，宿主查 `Context` 里有没有这个名字"},"1347":{"id":"/docs/plugin-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**插件名** —— 比如 `\"fuyubot.manage\"`，宿主查同名插件是不是 `Active`"},"1348":{"id":"/docs/plugin-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"硬依赖决定能不能跑，软依赖只决定排队位置"},"1349":{"id":"/docs/plugin-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"inject 里的名字不齐就不激活，停在 Pending 等着；soft_inject 只影响排序，不齐也照常激活。名字可以是服务名，也可以是插件名。"},"1350":{"id":"/docs/plugin-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"inject（硬）"},"1351":{"id":"/docs/plugin-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"[&quot;storage.mongo&quot;]"},"1352":{"id":"/docs/plugin-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"不齐就不激活"},"1353":{"id":"/docs/plugin-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"soft_inject（软）"},"1354":{"id":"/docs/plugin-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"[&quot;cache.redis&quot;]"},"1355":{"id":"/docs/plugin-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"只影响排队位置"},"1356":{"id":"/docs/plugin-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"宿主检查：这个名字在不在？"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/plugin-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"服务名或插件名都认"},"1358":{"id":"/docs/plugin-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"不在"},"1359":{"id":"/docs/plugin-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"在"},"1360":{"id":"/docs/plugin-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"Pending"},"1361":{"id":"/docs/plugin-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"等着——不是失败"},"1362":{"id":"/docs/plugin-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"激活"},"1363":{"id":"/docs/plugin-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"排在有软依赖的后面"},"1364":{"id":"/docs/plugin-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"三件事值得先记住："},"1365":{"id":"/docs/plugin-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**`Pending` 不是失败。** 它表示「还没轮到」或「等的东西还没来」。真正的失败只有两种：\n你的 `plugin_start` 报错，或者你依赖的**提供者已经 `Failed`**（那时你也会被级联标成 `Failed`）。"},"1366":{"id":"/docs/plugin-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**软依赖不保证顺序。** 它只是排序偏好：软依赖齐的先上，不齐的也照样上，只是排后面。\n要「他必须先于我」就写 `inject`，别用 `soft_inject`。"},"1367":{"id":"/docs/plugin-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**依赖是准入，不是注入。** 宿主不会把那个服务的引用塞给你——你仍然自己去 `get_service`\n拿。`inject` 只保证「轮到我的时候它一定在」。"},"1368":{"id":"/docs/plugin-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"排查看 `fuyubot status`：`pending` 那一栏会列出插件名**和它还缺哪些**。"},"1369":{"id":"/docs/plugin-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"完整实例见插件联动。命令表是宿主预置的 `fuyubot.host.commands`，\n插件用 `call_service` 登记，不需要再 `soft_inject` 等 `/help`；细节见命令表与 /help。"},"1370":{"id":"/docs/plugin-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Rust 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rust/\" />"},"1371":{"id":"/docs/plugin-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"C 与 C++ 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/native/\" />"},"1372":{"id":"/docs/plugin-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Go 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/go/\" />"},"1373":{"id":"/docs/plugin-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"订阅与事件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/events/\" />"},"1374":{"id":"/docs/plugin-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"命令表与 /help\" href=\"/docs/plugin/command-table/\" />"},"1375":{"id":"/docs/plugin-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"TDLib 对象缓存\" href=\"/docs/plugin/cache/\" />"},"1376":{"id":"/docs/plugin-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"调用 TDLib\" href=\"/docs/plugin/tdlib/\" />"},"1377":{"id":"/docs/plugin-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"简化封装\" href=\"/docs/plugin/simplify/\" />"},"1378":{"id":"/docs/plugin-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"外部仓库插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/external/\" />"},"1379":{"id":"/docs/plugin-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"富消息\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rich/\" />"},"1380":{"id":"/docs/plugin-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"工具与中间件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/tools/\" />"},"1381":{"id":"/docs/plugin-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"异步等待\" href=\"/docs/plugin/async/\" />"},"1382":{"id":"/docs/plugin-96","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"ABI 契约\" href=\"/docs/plugin/abi/\" />"},"1383":{"id":"/docs/plugin-97","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"调试与安装\" href=\"/docs/plugin/testing/\" />"},"1384":{"id":"/docs/plugin-98","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"插件名只允许字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`（它会拼进源码和 TOML）；目录名里的 `.` / `-` 换成 `_` 当 crate 名\n（`fuyubot.weather` → `fuyubot_weather`）。"},"1385":{"id":"/docs/plugin-99","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"**原生插件名来自插件包根上的 `plugin.json`**（静态读，不加载）；没有清单的旧形态平铺 dll\n只能按文件名认。`fuyubot plugin list` 两种都列。"},"1386":{"id":"/docs/plugin-100","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"脚本插件的目录与身份是另一套（`plugins/scripts/<目录>/` + `[tool.fuyubot]` / `\"fuyubot\"` 段），\n见脚本插件。"},"1387":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"page","content":"插件联动","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage"},"1388":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage","content":"用共享服务互相调用、用软依赖排好启动顺序"},"1389":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"先选通道"},"1390":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#联动结构","content":"联动结构"},"1391":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#提供方把能力做成服务","content":"提供方：把能力做成服务"},"1392":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"1. 写方法"},"1393":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"2. 打包 VTable 与它引用的缓冲"},"1394":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#3-start-注册stop-放下","content":"3. `start()` 注册，`stop()` 放下"},"1395":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"4. 提供方也要能单独活"},"1396":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"消费方：按名字调用 + 软依赖"},"1397":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"`soft_inject` 做了什么、没做什么"},"1398":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"软依赖写服务名还是插件名？"},"1399":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"软还是硬？"},"1400":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"生命周期与所有权"},"1401":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"其它语言"},"1402":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"排查"},"1403":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"一页检查清单"},"1404":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage","content":"插件之间没有共享的 Rust 类型，也没有彼此的符号表。原生插件（cdylib）跑在同一个进程里，\n但只通过宿主的 C ABI 打交道。想「A 把自己的能力借给 B 用」，只有宿主提供的那几条通道。"},"1405":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage","content":"这篇讲最常用的一条：**命名服务 + 软依赖**。示例服务叫 `demo.notes`：一个插件提供\n「笔记」能力，另一个插件按名字调用它。"},"1406":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage","content":"> 命令表已经不由 `/help` 插件提供，而是宿主预置的 `fuyubot.host.commands`。\n> 那部分见命令表与 /help；缓存服务见 TDLib 对象缓存。\n> 本文只讲通用的共享服务模式。"},"1407":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事             | 通道               | 有返回值 | 对方必须在？ |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- | ---- | ------ |\n| 广播「发生了什么」，不关心谁在听 | 事件总线 `emit` / 订阅 | 否    | 否      |","table":"table-0"},"1408":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事            | 通道                                               | 有返回值        | 对方必须在？   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------- | -------- |\n| 调一个能力，**当场要结果** | 命名服务 `provide_service(_shared)` + `call_service` | 是（JSON 字符串） | 是（调用那一刻） |","table":"table-0"},"1409":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事            | 通道                                | 有返回值 | 对方必须在？ |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------- | ---- | ------ |\n| 让宿主 / AI 能发现并调用 | 工具表 `register_tool` + `call_tool` | 是    | 是      |","table":"table-0"},"1410":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事           | 通道                       | 有返回值 | 对方必须在？ |\n| -------------- | ------------------------ | ---- | ------ |\n| 只要求「我启动时它已经在了」 | `inject` / `soft_inject` | —    | 不负责传值  |","table":"table-0"},"1411":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"服务适合「一个插件提供能力、其它插件按名字调」：缓存、鉴权、数据源、笔记都属于这一类。\n它不替代事件——事件是**通知**，服务是**调用**。两者可以叠：服务方法内部照样能 `emit`。"},"1412":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#联动结构","content":"提供方：`start()` 里 `provide_service_shared(\"demo.notes\", &vtable)`；"},"1413":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#联动结构","content":"消费方：`call_service(\"demo.notes\", \"add\", …)`；"},"1414":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#联动结构","content":"消费方**不链接**提供方，也不 import 它的代码，只认服务名、方法名和 JSON 协议；"},"1415":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#联动结构","content":"需要「提供方先起来」时，消费方用 `soft_inject` / `inject` 声明，但**不传值**。"},"1416":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#联动结构","content":"服务名建议用反向域名（`demo.notes`），方法名用动词；协议字段**只增不改**，\n破坏性改动时把 `ServiceVTable.version` 加一（宿主不校验，但调用方可以据此判断）。\n坏入参不要 panic——回一个带 `error` 的 JSON，调用方才有机会降级。"},"1417":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#提供方把能力做成服务","content":"下面代码用 `fuyubot-abi` 的类型写。外部 Rust 插件直接依赖 crates.io 上的\n`fuyubot-abi`，拿到的是同一套 `ServiceVTable` / `ServiceMethod` / `Plugin` / `define_plugin!`。"},"1418":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"服务方法只有一个签名：收 JSON、回 JSON（或 `NULL` 表示失败）。"},"1419":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"方法跑在**调用方线程**上。消费方若在命令回调（接收循环线程）里调它，这里就不能做慢事——\n否则整个宿主一起卡住。要慢慢做的活，在方法里排个队、立刻返回。"},"1420":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"⚠️ `ServiceMethodFn` 是 `extern \"C\"`，**方法里不能有 panic**：逃出这个边界的 panic 会直接\nabort 整个宿主，不是只挂你的插件。解析失败回 `{\"ok\":false,\"error\":\"…\"}`；确实可能 panic 的\n代码段自己 `catch_unwind`。"},"1421":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`ServiceVTable` 里全是裸指针：`name` 指向服务名，`methods` 指向方法数组，每个方法项又指向\n自己的名字。这些缓冲必须和 VTable **活一样久**，所以打包进同一个结构体，一起放进 `Box`："},"1422":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"几个容易写错的点："},"1423":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`Vec` 的**堆缓冲**在结构体移动时不会跟着搬，所以 `Box::new` 之后\n`names[i].as_ptr()` / `methods.as_ptr()` 仍然有效。**别在注册之后再 `push`**。"},"1424":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`version` 是提供方自己的协议版本，宿主**不校验**；它只用于调用方自己判断。"},"1425":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`context` 会原样传给每个方法。需要实例状态就把 `self` 指针放这里；需要问调用方就把\n`HostApi` 放这里（它是 `Copy` 的，跨线程可用）。"},"1426":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#3-start-注册stop-放下","content":"**跨插件共享必须用 `provide_service_shared`。** `provide_service` 写的是调用者自己的\n子作用域，兄弟插件沿父链往上看不到它；两个插件各注册一份同名私有服务也不会冲突，\n但也就谈不上联动。`_shared` 写进程级的根表，同名会和别人撞。"},"1427":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#3-start-注册stop-放下","content":"`ServiceHandle` **不是** RAII：它没有 `Drop`，丢在一边不会注销。插件卸载时宿主按 owner\n回滚它注册的一切。这里的 `Option<Box<NotesService>>` 只是为了**保活 VTable**。"},"1428":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"提供服务时给自己留一份兜底：没有消费方来调，插件仍然能工作。\n别把「有人来调我」当成自己启动的前提。"},"1429":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"`call_service` 是普通安全函数，返回 `Result<String, AbiError>`："},"1430":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"服务不存在 / 方法不存在 / 方法指针是 `None` → `Err`；"},"1431":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"方法返回 `NULL` → `Err`（v6 起 `NULL` 表示失败，空串才是「成功但没输出」）；"},"1432":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"方法返回字符串 → 立刻拷成 `String`，调用方拿到的是自己的一份。"},"1433":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"⚠️ 错误类型不细分「服务不存在」和「没有这个方法」。日志里要把服务名、方法名一起打出来。"},"1434":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"宿主在 `plugin_init` **之前**读 `plugin_manifest` 里的依赖列表（`define_plugin!` 会把\n`Plugin::soft_inject()` 写进去）。同步阶段分两轮："},"1435":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"先激活「硬依赖齐 **且** 软依赖也齐」的插件；"},"1436":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"再激活「只有硬依赖齐」的插件。"},"1437":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"但它**不是**「提供方一定在」的保证："},"1438":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"提供方卡在硬依赖上时，消费方的软依赖不算齐，第二轮照样激活消费方；"},"1439":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"提供方 `start()` 报错，软依赖同样不阻塞消费方；"},"1440":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"运行期中提供方被卸载，消费方仍处于 `Active`，之后的每次调用都要自己处理错误。"},"1441":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"一句话：**软依赖管排队，不管可用性**。所以上面的 `match` 分支不是客套，是必须的。"},"1442":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"| 写法                  | 宿主查什么                    | 什么时候用                 |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| 服务名（`\"demo.notes\"`） | 根作用域的 `Context` 里有没有这个名字 | 推荐。换一个插件提供同名服务，排序仍然成立 |","table":"table-1"},"1443":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"| 写法                           | 宿主查什么              | 什么时候用               |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------- |\n| 插件名（`\"demo.notes-provider\"`） | 有没有同名插件处于 `Active` | 只关心「那个插件」而不是「那个能力」时 |","table":"table-1"},"1444":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"⚠️ 软依赖写**私有**服务名是排不上序的：兄弟插件看不到它，管理器在根作用域里也查不到。\n跨插件的能力一律走 `provide_service_shared`，依赖也写同一个服务名。"},"1445":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景              | 选择                    |\n| --------------- | --------------------- |\n| 没有它也要能跑，只是少一个功能 | `soft_inject` + 运行期降级 |","table":"table-2"},"1446":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景                     | 选择            |\n| ---------------------- | ------------- |\n| 没有数据库 / 鉴权就完全没意义，宁可别启动 | `inject`（硬依赖） |","table":"table-2"},"1447":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景                 | 选择                 |\n| ------------------ | ------------------ |\n| 只要求「它先起来」，不直接调它的服务 | `soft_inject` 写插件名 |","table":"table-2"},"1448":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景             | 选择                 |\n| -------------- | ------------------ |\n| 能力名稳定、可能有替代提供者 | `soft_inject` 写服务名 |","table":"table-2"},"1449":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"硬依赖的语义是**准入**：缺了就不激活，停在 `Pending` 等；如果提供它的插件已经 `Failed`，\n依赖方会被级联标成 `Failed`。但它也不传值——到了 `start()` 里，你仍然要自己\n`get_service` / `call_service`。"},"1450":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"依赖声明不要写进配置：manifest 是权威来源，`define_plugin!` 从 trait 自动生成。\n只有没有 `plugin_manifest` 的 v3 老插件，宿主才回退到 `[plugin.<名字>].inject` /\n`.soft_inject`（manifest 该侧非空时**覆盖**配置，不是合并）。见\n插件总览。"},"1451":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事      | 规则                                      |\n| ------ | --------------------------------------- |\n| 什么时候注册 | `start()`。`init()` 阶段插件还没被准入，别在那时对外暴露能力 |","table":"table-3"},"1452":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事         | 规则                                       |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 注册进宿主的是什么 | 裸指针，**不复制**。VTable 和它引用的字符串 / 方法数组必须一直活着 |","table":"table-3"},"1453":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事      | 规则                                                                |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 什么时候释放 | `plugin_stop` 先跑，然后宿主 `rollback_owner` 撤销注册。`stop()` 里放下 `Box` 即可 |","table":"table-3"},"1454":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事    | 规则                                                                 |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 同名冲突 | `provide_service_shared` 返回无效句柄，宿主只打一条 `warn`；调用方必须检查 `is_valid()` |","table":"table-3"},"1455":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事     | 规则                       |\n| ----- | ------------------------ |\n| 方法返回值 | 提供方持有，宿主当场拷走；不要跨调用保存那个指针 |","table":"table-3"},"1456":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事                 | 规则                         |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `get_service` 的指针 | 同样是借的。别长期缓存——提供方一旦卸载，指针就悬空 |","table":"table-3"},"1457":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事     | 规则                                   |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 方法在哪跑 | 调用方线程，同步执行。命令回调里调服务 = 在接收循环线程上跑，不能阻塞 |","table":"table-3"},"1458":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事     | 规则                                               |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| 输入可信吗 | 共享服务任何插件都能调。方法里自己校验 JSON、限制大小、别信 `context` 之外的东西 |","table":"table-3"},"1459":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言   | 提供方                                          | 消费方                                         |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Rust | `provide_service` / `provide_service_shared` | `call_service`（推荐），或 `get_service` + 自己扫方法表 |","table":"table-4"},"1460":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言      | 提供方                | 消费方                                                            |\n| ------- | ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| C / C++ | VTable 里第 9 / 20 项 | `call_service`（第 24 项，v6 起）；`get_service` + 扫 `methods[i]` 仍能跑 |","table":"table-4"},"1461":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言  | 提供方                       | 消费方 |\n| --- | ------------------------- | --- |\n| Go  | 同上（c-shared 不能卸载，见 ABI 页） | 同上  |","table":"table-4"},"1462":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言               | 提供方  | 消费方                  |\n| ---------------- | ---- | -------------------- |\n| Python / JS / TS | 暂不支持 | 薄 SDK 还没暴露服务调用，见脚本插件 |","table":"table-4"},"1463":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"> 自己 `get_service` 再直调**能跑，但宿主不在场**：这次调用不算「经过宿主」，所以\n> 提供方的 `current_plugin()` 拿不到调用方（返回 `None`）、失败也没有 `last_error` 细节。\n> 要身份和错误信息就用 `call_service`。"},"1464":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"C 侧的字段布局与调用示例见 插件 ABI 和\n原生插件。"},"1465":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"服务注册失败：宿主日志里有一行 `注册共享服务 … 失败: 命名服务 … 已经注册过了`\n（或「收到了空 vtable」）。"},"1466":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"调用失败：日志里要带服务名 + 方法名；`last_error` 会有具体原因。"},"1467":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"谁在跑、谁在等：`/plugins` 走宿主预置的 `fuyubot.host.plugins` 服务，会列出\n`active` / `pending`（带 `missing`）/ `failed`（带 `reason`）；`fuyubot status` 读的是\n实例发布的同一份快照。"},"1468":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"依赖声明从哪来：`plugin_manifest`。激活时日志里那行\n`激活 <名字> v<版本>（硬依赖 N、软依赖 M）` 就是宿主实际读到的数量。"},"1469":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"命令表 / 缓存是宿主预置服务，不会再出现「等 `/help` 先起来」这种依赖。"},"1470":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"提供方用 `provide_service_shared`，方法名和 JSON 协议写进文档。"},"1471":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"VTable、方法数组、名字缓冲装在同一个 `Box` 里，注册后不再扩容。"},"1472":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"检查 `ServiceHandle::is_valid()`；`stop()` 里放下持有物，不手动 free 宿主的东西。"},"1473":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"消费方对 `call_service` 的失败有降级分支，不 `unwrap`。"},"1474":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"可选联动用 `soft_inject`，并接受「提供方可能不在」；缺了就活不了才用 `inject`。"},"1475":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"方法里不做慢活、不阻塞调用方线程；也不让 panic 逃出 `extern \"C\"` 边界。"},"1476":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"命令登记走 `fuyubot.host.commands`，不需要再软依赖 `/help`。"},"1477":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"page","content":"迁移指南","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration"},"1478":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration","content":"目录包迁移（平铺 dll → plugins/<id>/）与 0.1.4 命令表迁移"},"1479":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#先看现在是什么形态","content":"先看现在是什么形态"},"1480":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"自动迁移"},"1481":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#手工迁移","content":"手工迁移"},"1482":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#原生插件","content":"原生插件"},"1483":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#脚本插件","content":"脚本插件"},"1484":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#命令表迁移014","content":"命令表迁移（0.1.4）"},"1485":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#验证","content":"验证"},"1486":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"回滚"},"1487":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"1488":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration","content":"旧版本把原生插件平铺在 `plugins/*.dll`，现在推荐一个插件一个目录："},"1489":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration","content":"平铺 dll 仍然能加载，但目录包才有静态元数据：`plugin list` 能显示版本、依赖、平台，\n商店和安装器也能按 `plugin.json` 校验。新插件请直接用目录包。"},"1490":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#先看现在是什么形态","content":"输出会分成「目录包 / 旧平铺 dll / 脚本插件 / 已禁用」几段。只有旧形态需要迁移。"},"1491":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"先空跑，确认它准备做什么："},"1492":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"确认后执行："},"1493":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"它会："},"1494":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"对每个平铺 dll（带同名 `.dll.disable` 的也认）读取导出信息，取插件 id 和版本；"},"1495":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"新建 `plugins/<id>/bin/`，把 dll 和它旁边同名的依赖文件一起移进去；"},"1496":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"写一份 `plugin.json`；"},"1497":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"对旧脚本目录补一个 `plugin.json`（脚本本身不动）；"},"1498":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"内置插件和已经是目录包的插件跳过，重复执行不会重复迁移。"},"1499":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"迁移完再跑一次 `fuyubot plugin list`，然后启动实例验证。"},"1500":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#自动迁移","content":"> Go 编译的 c-shared 插件在迁移时会**永久映射**进当前进程，迁移进程随后退出，不会再卸载它。\n> 这是正常现象；`--dry-run` 不会写文件。"},"1501":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#手工迁移","content":"自动迁移不适用时，按下面的步骤做。"},"1502":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#原生插件","content":"建目录 `plugins/<id>/bin/`；"},"1503":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#原生插件","content":"把 `weather.dll` 移进去，旁边运行时需要的依赖库也一起移；"},"1504":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#原生插件","content":"在 `plugins/<id>/plugin.json` 写："},"1505":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#原生插件","content":"`id` 必须和插件 `plugin_init` 返回的名字一致；`version` 写真实版本，不要写 `0.0.0`。"},"1506":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#脚本插件","content":"脚本插件仍然放在 `plugins/scripts/<目录>/`，只需要补一个可选的 `plugin.json`："},"1507":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#脚本插件","content":"`kind` 写 `python` 或 `js`，`entry` 指向入口脚本。脚本自己的 `pyproject.toml` /\n`package.json` 保持原样。"},"1508":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#命令表迁移014","content":"目录包迁移只改文件结构；命令表在 0.1.4 还换了一次主人："},"1509":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#命令表迁移014","content":"旧：`/help` 插件提供 `fuyubot.help.commands`，插件软依赖它；"},"1510":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#命令表迁移014","content":"新：宿主提供 `fuyubot.host.commands`，`/help` 只读；"},"1511":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#命令表迁移014","content":"旧服务名保留为兼容别名，但新代码应直接用新名字；"},"1512":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#命令表迁移014","content":"旧登记默认 `role=user` / `scopes=private+group`，不需要补字段也能跑。"},"1513":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#命令表迁移014","content":"完整对照和检查清单见命令表与 /help。"},"1514":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#验证","content":"`plugin list` 里能看到目录包，版本、平台、依赖都对；"},"1515":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#验证","content":"回放 / 启动日志里没有 `BundleNameMismatch`、`PlatformMismatch`、`EntryMissing`；"},"1516":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#验证","content":"原来的命令、服务和配置段还能用。"},"1517":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"迁移只是移动文件，没有改插件本体："},"1518":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"把 `plugins/<id>/bin/` 里的 dll 和依赖移回 `plugins/`；"},"1519":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"删掉 `plugins/<id>/`；"},"1520":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"脚本插件删掉新加的 `plugin.json` 即可。"},"1521":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#回滚","content":"回滚前先停掉正在运行的实例。"},"1522":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**迁移后插件没加载**"},"1523":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"平铺 dll 和目录包同时存在时，两个都会被扫到，可能重复注册。迁移是「移动」，\n正常情况下不会同时存在；手工迁移时记得删掉平铺那份。"},"1524":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"检查 `plugin.json` 的 `id` 是否与 `plugin_init` 的名字一致。"},"1525":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**提示 `GoRequiresManifest`**"},"1526":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"Go 插件没有 `plugin.json` 时加载器拒绝加载，因为 Go 的库一旦映射就不能卸载。\n先迁移出 `plugin.json` 再启动；或者用 `fuyubot plugin migrate` 处理。"},"1527":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**提示 `platforms` 不匹配**"},"1528":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"`platforms` 为空或 `[\"any\"]` 表示全平台；否则必须包含当前系统，例如\n`windows-x86_64`、`linux-aarch64`、`macos-aarch64`。"},"1529":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**脚本插件被当成原生插件**"},"1530":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"脚本目录要放在 `plugins/scripts/` 下，不要放在 `plugins/` 根上。"},"1531":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"**配置段还需要改吗**"},"1532":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#常见问题","content":"不需要。配置段仍是 `[plugin.<id>]`；迁移只改目录结构，不改插件 id。"},"1533":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"page","content":"C 与 C++ 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native"},"1534":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"同一份头文件、extern \"C\"、用你自己的工具链编译"},"1535":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#头文件","content":"头文件"},"1536":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#一用-buildrs-落盘推荐与-rust-插件同一个来源","content":"一、用 `build.rs` 落盘（推荐，与 Rust 插件同一个来源）"},"1537":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#二从本机已构建的-fuyubot-里取手头有源码时最省事","content":"二、从本机已构建的 `fuyubot` 里取（手头有源码时最省事）"},"1538":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#三没有-rust-工具链","content":"三、没有 Rust 工具链"},"1539":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#拿到之后","content":"拿到之后"},"1540":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"七个符号"},"1541":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"C"},"1542":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"C++"},"1543":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"常用 ABI 怎么调（C / C++ 同一套）"},"1544":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编译（你自己的工具链）"},"1545":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"1546":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"1547":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"注意"},"1548":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C 与 C++ 用**同一份头文件** `fuyubot_plugin.h`，差别只有两条：导出符号要不要放进 `extern \"C\"`，\n以及用什么拼 JSON。头文件是**产物**，不是源码——它由 cbindgen 从 `fuyubot-abi` 的 Rust 定义生成，\n权威副本是 `fuyubot_abi::PLUGIN_HEADER`，别手改。"},"1549":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C / C++ / Go 没有 async 运行时：请求与更新用回调（`on`），工具结果用\n`call_tool_result` 同步拿。Rust 侧有 `ResponseRouter`（可 await），见 异步等待；\n脚本侧有自己的异步写法，见脚本插件。"},"1550":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"用 AI Agent 写？本站导出了 `llms.txt` / `llms-full.txt` 和每页的 `content.md`，\n怎么喂见插件总览 › 用 AI Agent 写插件。"},"1551":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#头文件","content":"`fuyubot_plugin.h` **不在任何仓库里**：`fuyubot-abi` 也不把生成物打进 crate，它是构建时产物，\n每台机器现生成一次。三条路拿到它，任选一条。"},"1552":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#一用-buildrs-落盘推荐与-rust-插件同一个来源","content":"头文件的内容就是 `fuyubot_abi::PLUGIN_HEADER` 这个常量（cbindgen 生成的原文），所以只要有东西\n能编译 `fuyubot-abi`，就能把它落出来。`build.rs` 只是这一小步，**不是**把插件改成 Rust 写。"},"1553":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#一用-buildrs-落盘推荐与-rust-插件同一个来源","content":"**工程里已经有 `Cargo.toml`**（顺手用 Rust 写工具 / 测试很常见）——加两处："},"1554":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#一用-buildrs-落盘推荐与-rust-插件同一个来源","content":"build 脚本的 cwd 就是包根，写相对路径 `\"fuyubot_plugin.h\"` 也对；用 `CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR` 拼只是把\n「落在包根」写明，搬目录或指向 `../` 时不靠这条约定。"},"1555":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#一用-buildrs-落盘推荐与-rust-插件同一个来源","content":"**纯 C/C++ 工程**（一个 Cargo 工程都没有）——在工程根造一个只为落头文件的小 crate 挂在旁边："},"1556":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#一用-buildrs-落盘推荐与-rust-插件同一个来源","content":"`cargo new` 带的空 `src/lib.rs` 留着就行（只为让 manifest 有个 target）。`header-gen/target/` 与\n生成出来的 `fuyubot_plugin.h` 都进 `.gitignore`，别提交。Go 插件用的是同一招。"},"1557":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#二从本机已构建的-fuyubot-里取手头有源码时最省事","content":"`fuyubot-abi` 构建时把生成物写进 `$OUT_DIR`，落盘位置就是："},"1558":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#二从本机已构建的-fuyubot-里取手头有源码时最省事","content":"按修改时间取最新的一份，复制到你工程根："},"1559":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#二从本机已构建的-fuyubot-里取手头有源码时最省事","content":"⚠️ `<hash>` 随构建参数变，同一份 `target/` 里会躺着几十份历史副本（有的是半年前旧 ABI），\n所以必须按时间取最新——**别把某个 hash 目录写进脚本或文档**，它明天就不存在了。"},"1560":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#三没有-rust-工具链","content":"头文件是纯文本，找一台已经构建过的机器、CI 产物或同事那里拷**同一份**即可，不用为此装 Rust。\n前提只有一条：**这份头文件的 ABI 版本必须与你机器上的 `fuyubot` 一致**。"},"1561":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#拿到之后","content":"校验版本：头文件里应是 `#define ABI_VERSION 6`（ABI v6）。对不上的旧头文件会缺 `HostApiVTable`\n尾部字段，宿主加载时直接以 `VersionMismatch` / `VTableTooSmall` 拒绝——不会带病跑。"},"1562":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#拿到之后","content":"`#include \"fuyubot_plugin.h\"` 即可，C 与 C++ 共用；编译时用 `-I` 指向它所在目录（见下文「编译」）。"},"1563":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#拿到之后","content":"**不要手改**：改 ABI 要改 `fuyubot-abi` 的 Rust 定义，头文件由 cbindgen 重新生成。"},"1564":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#拿到之后","content":"**不要提交**：加进 `.gitignore`，升级 `fuyubot` / `fuyubot-abi` 后重新生成一次。"},"1565":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"v3 是四件套，v4 又加了三个（都可以不写，但写了才有对应能力）。"},"1566":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 说明                                                           |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 比 `host->version != ABI_VERSION`，存下 VTable，返回 `PluginHandle` |","table":"table-0"},"1567":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| -------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 订阅/注册；返回 `0` 表示成功 |","table":"table-0"},"1568":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| ------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 清状态；只登记元数据的插件可以不写 |","table":"table-0"},"1569":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 说明                                                |\n| -------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 释放本插件 `malloc` 出来的字符串（`plugin_manifest` 返回的那块也走它） |","table":"table-0"},"1570":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                | 必须吗   | 说明                                                            |\n| ----------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | v4 可选 | 返回自描述 JSON（名字 / 版本 / `inject` / `soft_inject`），宿主在 `init` 之前读 |","table":"table-0"},"1571":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                    | 必须吗   | 说明                                   |\n| --------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | v4 可选 | 静态返回 `ABI_VERSION`；宿主与静态检查工具不加载也能看到它 |","table":"table-0"},"1572":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗   | 说明                                                 |\n| -------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | v4 可选 | ABI 版本不匹配时宿主靠它回收 `init` 分配的状态（那时不能调 `plugin_stop`） |","table":"table-0"},"1573":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"`PluginHandle` 的判据是「`abi_version != 0` **且** `context` 非空」，所以 `context` 不能给 `NULL`。\n版本不对就返回全零句柄，宿主会把它当成拒绝加载。"},"1574":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"`ABI_VERSION` 与 `FUYUBOT_EXPORT` 都来自头文件，不要自己写死。"},"1575":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"同 C，**唯一的硬差别**是七个导出符号必须在 `extern \"C\"` 里——C++ 会改函数名（mangling），\n宿主按 ABI 定死的名字 `dlsym`，改了就找不到。"},"1576":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"`C-unwind` 对 C/C++ 而言与普通 C 调用**ABI 一致**，但 C++ 的异常照样能穿过这个边界——\n逃到宿主那边的异常是未定义行为。**在回调内部把异常处理完再返回**。"},"1577":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"每个函数第一个参数都是 `g_host->host_ctx`。下面把常用的走了一遍："},"1578":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"⚠️ 三条所有权规则（跨界最容易出事的地方）："},"1579":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"`td_execute` / `get_config` / `call_tool_result` / `list_tools` / `list_plugins` 返回的\n`const char *` 是**宿主线程局部缓冲**，下一次宿主调用之前有效——要留就当场 `strdup`，\n**不要 free 它**。"},"1580":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"反过来，只有 `plugin_manifest` 返回的那块是**你自己 malloc 的**，宿主读完用\n`plugin_free_string` 还给你（所以必须真能 free，别返回静态字符串）。"},"1581":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"`on` 的 `filter_json` 里 `event_type` 键只用来**选通道**，不参与负载匹配。"},"1582":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"`/utf-8` 省掉的后果很难看：中文注释被按系统代码页拆坏，编译器报的是「注释提前结束、后面全是语法错误」。"},"1583":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编完装进插件目录："},"1584":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"每个插件在 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下有自己的一段配置（见配置文件）。\nC 侧直接调 VTable 上的函数。`section` 用配置文件里的段名（`plugin.ping`），**空串 = 自己那段**："},"1585":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"两点与其它函数一致：**返回值是宿主线程局部缓冲**（读完即弃，别 free）；`set_config`\n**没有 section 参数**——宿主按执行者身份判定，所以插件没法靠它写别人的段；\n要写别人得显式用 `set_config_section`（目标写在参数里，宿主会记一行「谁改了谁」，\n而 `[bot]` / `[telegram]` 这类顶层段归用户，写了会被拒）。"},"1586":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> C / C++ **不需要**任何封装——直接调 VTable 上的 `simplify_invoke` /\n> `simplify_invoke_result`（见下），或者照下面手写 `sendMessage`。"},"1587":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"先来一个能跑的：直接调 VTable 上的 `simplify_invoke` 发消息——宿主替你解析文本、等到真发出去、\n超时先撤回；结果经已有的 `\"response\"` 事件回投（带 `request_id`，与你收 TDLib 响应是同一个 `on` 通道）："},"1588":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"`on_update` 里按 `request_id == rid` 配对，就能从那条 `response` 事件里取出 `simplifyResult` JSON\n（和 `td_invoke_simplified` 的响应是同一个 `on` 通道，逻辑完全复用）。"},"1589":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage` 是**另一条路**——下面这些字段你都得自己拼对："},"1590":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                    |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，`text` 是 `formattedText`（`text` + `entities`） |","table":"table-1"},"1591":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                              |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Markdown / HTML | **不自己解析**：先 `td_execute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2），把返回的 `formattedText` 原样塞进去 |","table":"table-1"},"1592":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"1593":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                            |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"1594":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                     |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；callback 的 `data` 是 **base64** |","table":"table-1"},"1595":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果     | 手写的关键字段                                 |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 静音 / 保护内容 | 在 `options`（`messageSendOptions`）里，不是顶层 |","table":"table-1"},"1596":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                      |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | 请求号只到**临时消息**；要最终 `Message` 得再等 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-1"},"1597":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"要 Markdown 就分两步：先 `td_execute` 拿 `parseTextEntities` 的结果（一个 `formattedText`），\n把它的 `text` 与 `entities` 拼进上面的 `input_message_content`。方法名与字段名以\n`td_api.tl` 为准（见调用 TDLib）。"},"1598":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"模板里的 JSON 取值是**朴素查找**（`strstr`），不处理转义、不处理同名嵌套键；认真写就引一个 JSON 库。"},"1599":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"宿主返回的字符串是**线程局部缓冲**，只在下一次宿主调用之前有效——当场拷走，并且**不要试图释放它**。"},"1600":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"`set_config` 只写 `<项目根>/plugin-config/<插件名>.toml`（原子替换），**不改** `fuyubot.toml`；\n用户在 `fuyubot.toml` 里写过的键会拒绝写（见 配置文件）。"},"1601":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"想少拼 JSON，可以只发 `td_invoke_simplified` 需要的参数对象（`@type` 由宿主补），见 调用 TDLib。"},"1602":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"page","content":"富消息","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich"},"1603":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"messageRichMessage：块树排版、按钮行与本地 Markdown 转换"},"1604":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"三种源"},"1605":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"发送与编辑"},"1606":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮"},"1607":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"行内富文本：`richtext`"},"1608":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"覆盖靠测试钉着"},"1609":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 的富消息（`messageRichMessage`）是「一页排版」的消息：标题、段落、表格、代码块、\n按钮行……全是一块一块的**页块**（`InputPageBlock`），行内另有独立的富文本（`RichText`）。\nBot API 管它叫 Rich Messages。"},"1610":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 里**没有** `sendRichMessage` / `editRichMessage`，也没有自带的 md → 块树转换；\n`fuyubot-simplify` 的 `RichMessage` 把这层补齐了：发送 / 编辑就是\n`sendMessage` / `editMessageText` + `inputMessageRichMessage`，Markdown 转换在**本地**完成。"},"1611":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"RichMessage：三种构建方式，两个出口"},"1612":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown、服务端 HTML、手拼块树三条路都能产出同一个 RichMessage 类型；它只有两个出口——发送和编辑，各自落到对应的 TDLib 方法。"},"1613":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown"},"1614":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"from_markdown（本地转）"},"1615":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown / HTML"},"1616":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"server_markdown / server_html"},"1617":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"块树"},"1618":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"from_blocks（最底层）"},"1619":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"RichMessage"},"1620":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"三种方式产出同一个类型，下游只认它"},"1621":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"send_rich_message"},"1622":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"edit_rich_message"},"1623":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"sendMessage"},"1624":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"+ inputMessageRichMessage"},"1625":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"editMessageText"},"1626":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"+ inputMessageRichMessage"},"1627":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"`RichMessage` 内部是 `RichSource` 三选一："},"1628":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                               | 谁解析                              | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | -------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_markdown(md)` | **本地**转换器（对齐官方 Rich Markdown 全表） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"1629":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                                 | 谁解析                                | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_blocks(blocks)` | 你给现成块树（每块一条 `InputPageBlock` JSON） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"1630":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源        | 构造                                 | 谁解析              | 谁能发   |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------- | ---------------- | ----- |\n| Markdown | `RichMessage::server_markdown(md)` | **服务端**（发前拿不到块树） | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"1631":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源    | 构造                               | 谁解析     | 谁能发   |\n| ---- | -------------------------------- | ------- | ----- |\n| Html | `RichMessage::server_html(html)` | **服务端** | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"1632":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"本地转换器对着官方 Rich Markdown 表\n一类一例全覆盖：标题 / 段落 / 围栏代码（含 `math`）/ 引用与可展开引用 / 拉引 / 页脚 /\n列表与任务项 / 表格 / 分割线 / 公式 / 折叠块 / 拼贴与幻灯片 / 媒体（按扩展名猜类型）/\n地图 / 锚点 / 按钮行 / 思考占位 / 脚注；行内粗斜删码、标记、剧透、上下标、行内公式、\n自定义 emoji、时间、`mailto:` / `tel:` / `tg://user` / 锚点链接，以及那批 HTML 标签\n（`<u>` `<details>` `<tg-collage>` `<tg-button-row>` …）。**不认的一律当普通文本**\n（引用式链接、`<table>` 这类 HTML 块不会报错，只是原样保留）。"},"1633":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"参数是 `RichMessageParams`——与 `SendMessageParams` **分开的类型**（那边是「文本 + 媒体」\n二选一，混在一起互斥规则没人记得住）：`message` / `reply_to_message_id` / `topic_id`\n（`Option<Topic>`，见Simplify 封装）/ `reply_markup` /\n`clear_draft` / `timeout_ms`。"},"1634":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"和 `Simplify` 的其它方法一样，**等到结果才返回**（详见调用 TDLib）："},"1635":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                         | 发出的 `@type`   | 等到什么               | 返回                                                    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::send_rich_message(chat_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `sendMessage` | 响应 + 发送结局（成功 / 失败） | 最终 `Message`（⚠️ **阻塞**，回调里用 `send_rich_message_then`） |","table":"table-1"},"1636":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                                     | 发出的 `@type`       | 等到什么 | 返回                                           |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::edit_rich_message(chat_id, message_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `editMessageText` | 响应   | 改完的 `Message`（回调里用 `edit_rich_message_then`） |","table":"table-1"},"1637":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"最常用的两条捷径："},"1638":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮在 Markdown 里**没有语法**，一律显式构造：`RichButton::url / callback / user / copy_text`\n（`.style(RichButtonStyle)` 换样式），用 `with_buttons` / `with_button_row` 追加\n`inputPageBlockButtonRow`。"},"1639":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"`with_buttons` 只对 **Blocks 源**成立——`server_markdown` / `server_html` 的按钮要用\n服务端语法自己写进文本，对它们调 `with_buttons` 会报 `RichSourceNotBlocks`。"},"1640":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"块里的行内内容是独立的 `RichText`（31 个构造器，没有 offset/length）：\nMarkdown 语法能覆盖 21 个，剩下 10 个（`mention` / `hashtag` / `cashtag` /\n`bankCardNumber` / `tonAddress` / `botCommand` / `icon` / `button` / `diff` / `anchor`）\n没有 md 写法，用 `richtext::*` 拼好塞进块（配合 `with_block`）。"},"1641":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"`InputPageBlock` 一共 24 个构造器，本地转换器**全都能产出**（`thinking` 只能出现在草稿消息里，\n结构上仍可构造）；`with_block` 也留给「媒体已上传、要传 `inputPhoto` 句柄」这类 md 表达不了的场景。"},"1642":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"块级语法**一类一例**：`block_syntax_covers_the_official_table`（每块都再走一遍\n`td_api::InputPageBlock` 反序列化）；整段全格式回归闸是内联的 `official_sample_fully_deserializes`。"},"1643":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"加块 / 删块会让 `input_page_block_coverage_is_accounted_for` 失败——24 个构造器的\n分工表就烤在这条测试里。"},"1644":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"相关：调用 TDLib（`Simplify` 的其余方法）、插件总览。"},"1645":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"page","content":"Rust 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust"},"1646":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"依赖 fuyubot-abi，实现 Plugin trait + define_plugin! 的最小写法"},"1647":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"依赖"},"1648":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"最小可用插件"},"1649":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`Plugin` trait"},"1650":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调与状态","content":"回调与状态"},"1651":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#登记命令","content":"登记命令"},"1652":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"1653":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"常用 ABI 速查"},"1654":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#注册一个带处理器的工具","content":"注册一个带处理器的工具"},"1655":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"编译与安装"},"1656":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"Rust 插件只依赖一个 crate：`fuyubot-abi`。\n它给出 `HostApi`（VTable 的 Rust 封装）、`Plugin` trait、`define_plugin!` 宏与\n`ResponseRouter`；**没有第二层 SDK**——写插件就是实现一个 trait，再把 C ABI 导出交给宏。"},"1657":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"用 AI Agent 写？本站导出了 `llms.txt` / `llms-full.txt` 和每页的 `content.md`，\n怎么喂见插件总览 › 用 AI Agent 写插件。"},"1658":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"那个空的 `[workspace]` 不是多余的：没有它，cargo 会一路往上找父目录的 workspace 声明然后报错。\n`fuyubot-abi` 走**独立版本线**（不跟 bot 的版本号，当前 `0.1.3`）；ABI 契约版本是\n`fuyubot_abi::ABI_VERSION`（当前 **6**），编辑器里补全一下就有，别手抄。"},"1659":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"`define_plugin!(类型, \"插件名\")` 展开出七个导出符号\n（`plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_free_string` /\n`plugin_free_handle` / `fuyubot_abi_version` / `plugin_manifest`），\n并把插件的名字、crate 版本、`inject` / `soft_inject` 填进 `plugin_manifest`。"},"1660":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                   | 对应符号          | 说明                   |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------- | -------------------- |\n| `init(host) -> Result<Self, String>` | `plugin_init` | 构造状态；返回 `Err` = 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-0"},"1661":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                                    | 对应符号           | 说明                                  |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `start(&mut self, config_json) -> Result<(), String>` | `plugin_start` | 订阅 / 注册都写在这里；`config_json` 是宿主传来的配置 |","table":"table-0"},"1662":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                | 对应符号          | 说明                          |\n| ----------------- | ------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `stop(&mut self)` | `plugin_stop` | 可选，回收 `Box::into_raw` 之类的状态 |","table":"table-0"},"1663":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                        | 对应符号              | 说明        |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------- | --------- |\n| `inject() -> Vec<String>` | `plugin_manifest` | 硬依赖：缺了不激活 |","table":"table-0"},"1664":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                             | 对应符号              | 说明          |\n| ------------------------------ | ----------------- | ----------- |\n| `soft_inject() -> Vec<String>` | `plugin_manifest` | 软依赖：只影响排队顺序 |","table":"table-0"},"1665":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`define_plugin!` 还把 `init` / `start` / `stop` 包在 `catch_unwind` 里——和回调的\n`C-unwind` 是两层，**两层都要**：一层防 panic 逃出 ABI，一层防 panic 把宿主线程带走。"},"1666":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调与状态","content":"回调是裸函数指针，没有捕获环境。状态要么放插件字段、经 `user_data` 传进去："},"1667":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调与状态","content":"订阅句柄**不会**在 drop 时自动退订——`SubscriptionHandle` 只是个 `u64`。\n要提前退订就留住它、调 `host.off(handle)`；插件卸载时宿主会整批回滚，\n但 `user_data` 指向的状态还是得自己释放。"},"1668":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#登记命令","content":"命令表由宿主提供，在 `start()` 里登记即可，不需要等 `/help`、也不需要 `soft_inject`："},"1669":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#登记命令","content":"`role` / `scopes` / `hidden` 的默认值与语义见命令表与 /help。\n命令回调里回复用 `Command::reply_then`，不要自己拼 `sendMessage`（见配置文件）。"},"1670":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"每个插件在 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下有自己的一段（见配置文件）。"},"1671":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"`plugin_start` 收到的 `config_json` **不是**这一段。那是宿主给的运行环境信息\n（`plugins_dir` / `scripts_dir` / `spawn` 等）；你自己的配置用 `get_config(\"\", key)` 读（空 section = 自己那段）。"},"1672":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                           | 作用                                                                                                                             |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `get_config(section, key) -> Option<String>` | 读配置。`section` 用**配置文件里的段名**（`plugin.my.weather` / `[bot]` / 裸插件名都认），**空串 = 自己那段**；`key` 空串读整段、否则按点路径取键。返回 JSON 文本，找不到就是 `None` |","table":"table-1"},"1673":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                                    | 作用                                                           |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `set_config(key, value_json) -> Result<(), AbiError>` | 写**自己**的段。**没有 section 参数**——宿主按执行者身份判定，写不到别人那段。`key` 空串覆盖整段 |","table":"table-1"},"1674":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                                                 | 作用                                                                             |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `set_config_for(section, key, value_json) -> Result<(), AbiError>` | 写**指定插件**的段（跨插件同步设置）。`section` 同上；**只接受 `plugin.*`**，顶层归用户。规则与 `set_config` 一致 |","table":"table-1"},"1675":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"`set_config` **只写你自己那一个文件**（`<项目根>/plugin-config/<插件名>.toml`，原子替换），\n不碰 `fuyubot.toml`——用户写在里面的注释、顺序、凭据都安全。三层优先级，以及「用户在\n`fuyubot.toml` 里钉住的键会拒绝写」，见配置文件 · 插件自己的配置段。"},"1676":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"`HostApi` 上的方法就是 VTable 的一对一封装（都替你处理了 `CString` 与线程局部缓冲）："},"1677":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                   |\n| ---- | --------------------- |\n| 打日志  | `log(LogLevel, &str)` |","table":"table-2"},"1678":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么    | 用哪个                                                                           |\n| ------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 订阅 / 退订 | `on(event, Some(filter), cb, user_data)` / `off(handle)`；过滤器是 `{\"字段路径\": 期望值}` |","table":"table-2"},"1679":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么   | 用哪个                                       |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 发自定义事件 | `emit(event, payload_json)`——只送自己 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"1680":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么       | 用哪个                                                                        |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 发 TDLib 请求 | `td_invoke_simplified(method, params_json)`；响应走 `\"response\"` 通道（见调用 TDLib） |","table":"table-2"},"1681":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么        | 用哪个                        |\n| ----------- | -------------------------- |\n| 同步执行不碰网络的方法 | `td_execute(request_json)` |","table":"table-2"},"1682":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                                                                                      |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 工具   | `register_tool(descriptor, handler, user_data)` / `register_tool_meta` / `call_tool` / `call_tool_result` / `list_tools` |","table":"table-2"},"1683":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                                                           |\n| ---- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 服务   | `provide_service`（自己作用域）/ `provide_service_shared`（进程级）/ `get_service` / `call_service`，见插件联动 |","table":"table-2"},"1684":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                      |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 中间件  | `use_middleware(Stage::InPlugin, cb, user_data)`，见工具与中间件 |","table":"table-2"},"1685":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么  | 用哪个                                                                             |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 等一条更新 | `wait_for_update(filter_json, timeout_ms)`（阻塞）或 `ResponseRouter`（可 await），见异步等待 |","table":"table-2"},"1686":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                               |\n| ---- | --------------------------------- |\n| 看别人  | `list_tools()` / `list_plugins()` |","table":"table-2"},"1687":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#常用-abi-速查","content":"| 想干什么         | 用哪个                                                                                 |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| simplify 操作表 | `simplify_invoke(op_json)` / `simplify_invoke_result(op_json)`，见 ABI › simplify 操作表 |","table":"table-2"},"1688":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#注册一个带处理器的工具","content":"只想登记声明、不要处理器，就用 `register_tool_meta(descriptor_json)`。"},"1689":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"`define_plugin!` **一个 crate 只能展开一次**。一个 cdylib 就是一个插件——这不是限制，是设计：\n七个导出符号名由 ABI 定死，展开两次就是重复定义。"},"1690":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"要发消息、调 TDLib、等响应，见 调用 TDLib；要按字段过滤更新，见\n订阅与事件；契约本身见 ABI 契约。"}