s/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#17-异步版_then","content":"17. 异步版：`*_then`"},"1714":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#18-返回值与错误","content":"18. 返回值与错误"},"1715":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"19. 简化事件"},"1716":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"`fuyubot-simplify` 只做一件事：**把 TDLib 的输入拼好、把结果等回来**，返回值仍然是 TDLib 的原始 JSON\n（`Value` / `Vec<Value>`）。"},"1717":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"它是**运行时仓库里的 crate，不发 crates.io**（`publish = false`），所以只能按路径依赖："},"1718":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"写 `fuyubot-simplify = \"0.1\"` 会编不过。不想引路径依赖就用宿主暴露的 op 表\n（`simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result`，见 ABI › simplify 操作表）。"},"1719":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"三条贯穿全部方法的约定："},"1720":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"**每个方法都等到结果才返回**，不交回请求号；唯一的例外是 `formatted`（同步调用，压根没有等待）。"},"1721":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"**等待的方法是阻塞的**。插件的更新回调就跑在 TDLib 接收循环那个线程上，在那里等待=自己卡自己，\n等到的一定是超时。回调里一律用 `*_then`（见第 13 节）。"},"1722":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"失败一律是 `Err(SimplifyError)`，成功时的返回值见第 14 节。"},"1723":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"本文按**功能范围**分组；想知道这些方法内部怎么实现（为什么这么拼、为什么这么等），\n看开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的。"},"1724":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"**ABI v5 起这套语义不再只有 Rust 有。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑**同一份** `fuyubot-simplify` 代码\n（`fuyubot-simplify::ops`），经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张 **op 表**："},"1725":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"所以 Go / C / C++ / JS / TS / Python 插件都能用「发消息等结局、超时撤回、bot 与用户号挑不同反应\n方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树」，行为与 Rust 侧**逐字一致**——没有第二套实现。\n完整清单与结果形状见 ABI › simplify 操作表。"},"1726":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"Rust 插件**仍然用本页这些类型化方法**：它们有编译期检查与链式设置器，比拼 JSON 舒服。\n`ops` 那层是给「没有 Rust 类型系统可用」的调用方准备的。"},"1727":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#别的语言怎么用同一套语义","content":"除了发/改/删，这一层还收了四件「TDLib 里没有直觉上那个方法」的事：\n管理权 / 转发 /\n表情反应 / 连接状态。"},"1728":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"带标记的文本**不由本 crate 解析**——经**同步**的 `td_execute` 问 TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities`\n（为什么不能用异步，见开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的里的「文本链路」一节）。"},"1729":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ text: { description: '原始文本（还没解析的那种）。', type: 'String', required: true, }, parse_mode: { descriptio…\" />"},"1730":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"快捷构造：`Text::plain` / `Text::markdown` / `Text::markdown_v2` / `Text::html` / `Text::new(text, mode)`；\n`&str` / `String` 直接转成纯文本。"},"1731":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`                                   |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Plain`（默认） | **不发请求**，直接 `formattedText { text, entities: [] }` |","table":"table-0"},"1732":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`                       |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `Markdown`  | `textParseModeMarkdown` + `version: 1` |","table":"table-0"},"1733":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode`  | 发出的 `parse_mode`                       |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| `MarkdownV2` | `textParseModeMarkdown` + `version: 2` |","table":"table-0"},"1734":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"| `ParseMode` | 发出的 `parse_mode`    |\n| ----------- | ------------------- |\n| `Html`      | `textParseModeHTML` |","table":"table-0"},"1735":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"⚠️ **注意：MarkdownV2 的粗体是 `*x*`，不是 `**x**`。**\n`**bold**` 会被吞成 `bold` 而且**不给** bold entity，`__x__` 出来的是下划线。别按 CommonMark 的直觉写\n——这正是「不自己实现解析」的理由。"},"1736":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"拿到结果也没干活不符预期：**拿不到就退回纯文本**并打一条 `Warn` 日志（没接 TDLib、TDLib 报错都一样），\n一条 Markdown 写错的消息不该整条发不出去。"},"1737":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"`simplify.send_message(chat_id, &params)` → `Result<Value>`（**最终**那条 `Message`）。"},"1738":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ text: { description: '文本。只填它就是纯文本消息；和 media 一起填时它是那件媒体的标题。', type: 'Option<Text>', default: 'None'…\" />"},"1739":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"常用构造：`SendMessageParams::text(\"你好\")` / `SendMessageParams::media(photo)`，\n其余字段走 `..SendMessageParams::default()`。"},"1740":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"`topic_id` 不是裸 id，是 TDLib 的 `MessageTopic`——**四个构造器各有各的 id 类型**，选错了 TDLib 就拒："},"1741":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                 | 用在哪                  | 发出的 `topic_id`                                     |\n| ------------------ | -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Topic::forum(id)` | **论坛**群组，以及与 bot 的私聊 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicForum\",\"forum_topic_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1742":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                  | 用在哪           | 发出的 `topic_id`                                         |\n| ------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Topic::thread(id)` | **非论坛**群组的评论串 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicThread\",\"message_thread_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1743":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                           | 用在哪     | 发出的 `topic_id`                                                             |\n| ---------------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Topic::direct_messages(id)` | 频道的私信话题 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicDirectMessages\",\"direct_messages_chat_topic_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1744":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"| 构造                          | 用在哪   | 发出的 `topic_id`                                                      |\n| --------------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Topic::saved_messages(id)` | 收藏夹话题 | `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicSavedMessages\",\"saved_messages_topic_id\":…}` |","table":"table-1"},"1745":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"⚠️ 刻意**没有** `From<i64>`：论坛话题是 `int32`、评论串是 `int53`，一个裸数字说不清是哪一种，\n隐式转任何一个都会在另一种群里静默发错。（这一层以前固定按 `messageTopicThread` 拼，非论坛群以外全是错的。）"},"1746":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"七个变体对应 TDLib 的七个 `inputMessage*` 构造器："},"1747":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 变体                   | 内容类型                | 能设置的字段                                                       |\n| -------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Media::photo(file)` | `inputMessagePhoto` | `caption` / `thumbnail` / `width` / `height` / `has_spoiler` |","table":"table-2"},"1748":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 变体                   | 内容类型                | 能设置的字段                                                                         |\n| -------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Media::video(file)` | `inputMessageVideo` | 上面五个 + **`cover`** / **`start_timestamp`** / `duration` / `supports_streaming` |","table":"table-2"},"1749":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 变体                    | 内容类型                | 能设置的字段                                                                       |\n| --------------------- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Media::Audio { .. }` | `inputMessageAudio` | `caption` / **`album_cover_thumbnail`** / `duration` / `title` / `performer` |","table":"table-2"},"1750":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 变体                      | 内容类型                   | 能设置的字段                  |\n| ----------------------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `Media::document(file)` | `inputMessageDocument` | `caption` / `thumbnail` |","table":"table-2"},"1751":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 变体                        | 内容类型                    | 能设置的字段                                                                    |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Media::Animation { .. }` | `inputMessageAnimation` | `caption` / `thumbnail` / `duration` / `width` / `height` / `has_spoiler` |","table":"table-2"},"1752":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 变体                      | 内容类型                  | 能设置的字段                                                    |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Media::Sticker { .. }` | `inputMessageSticker` | `emoji`（**没有 caption**）/ `thumbnail` / `width` / `height` |","table":"table-2"},"1753":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 变体                          | 内容类型                   | 能设置的字段 |\n| --------------------------- | ---------------------- | ------ |\n| `Media::location(lat, lng)` | `inputMessageLocation` | —      |","table":"table-2"},"1754":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'InputFile::local(path)': { description: '本地文件路径 → inputFileLocal。&amp;str / String 一律当成路径。', type: 'I…\" />"},"1755":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"链式设置器都返回新的 `Media`，**只在真签名里有那个字段的变体上生效**（其余原样返回）："},"1756":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 设置器              | 作用范围                  | 字段        |\n| ---------------- | --------------------- | --------- |\n| `.caption(text)` | 图 / 视频 / 音频 / 文档 / 动图 | `caption` |","table":"table-3"},"1757":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 设置器                 | 作用范围      | 字段                                           |\n| ------------------- | --------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `.thumbnail(thumb)` | 上述五个 + 贴纸 | `thumbnail`（音频那个真名是 `album_cover_thumbnail`） |","table":"table-3"},"1758":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 设置器               | 作用范围 | 字段                          |\n| ----------------- | ---- | --------------------------- |\n| `.cover(file, 秒)` | 视频   | `cover` + `start_timestamp` |","table":"table-3"},"1759":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 设置器              | 作用范围        | 字段                           |\n| ---------------- | ----------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `.spoiler(bool)` | 图 / 视频 / 动图 | `has_spoiler`（发过去先遮住，点一下才显示） |","table":"table-3"},"1760":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 设置器           | 作用范围             | 字段                                  |\n| ------------- | ---------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `.size(w, h)` | 图 / 视频 / 动图 / 贴纸 | `width` / `height`（填 0 = TDLib 自己读） |","table":"table-3"},"1761":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 设置器            | 作用范围         | 字段         |\n| -------------- | ------------ | ---------- |\n| `.duration(秒)` | 视频 / 音频 / 动图 | `duration` |","table":"table-3"},"1762":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 设置器                | 作用范围 | 字段                   |\n| ------------------ | ---- | -------------------- |\n| `.streaming(bool)` | 视频   | `supports_streaming` |","table":"table-3"},"1763":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 设置器                             | 作用范围 | 字段                    |\n| ------------------------------- | ---- | --------------------- |\n| `.title(..)` / `.performer(..)` | 音频   | `title` / `performer` |","table":"table-3"},"1764":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"| 设置器          | 作用范围 | 字段      |\n| ------------ | ---- | ------- |\n| `.emoji(..)` | 贴纸   | `emoji` |","table":"table-3"},"1765":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"没设置的字段**整个不发**（不是发 `null`）。⚠️ 真库：`cover` **不支持**秘密聊天与阅后即焚消息。"},"1766":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#4-相册sendalbumparams","content":"`send_message_album(chat_id, &params)` → `Result<Vec<Value>>`（与 `medias` **同序**的最终消息）。"},"1767":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#4-相册sendalbumparams","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ medias: { description: '2–10 项，只有音频 / 文档 / 图片 / 视频能混成相册；项数不对直接 AlbumSize，不发请求。', type: 'Vec<Media>…\" />"},"1768":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#4-相册sendalbumparams","content":"⚠️ **相册发的时候带不上键盘**（真签名里没有 `reply_markup`）：先发，再拿返回的消息 id 调\n`edit_message_reply_markup`。"},"1769":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                         | 参数结构体            | 返回值           |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ---------------- | ------------- |\n| `edit_message_text(chat_id, msg, &params)` | `EditTextParams` | 改完的 `Message` |","table":"table-4"},"1770":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                            | 参数结构体               | 返回值           |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------- |\n| `edit_message_caption(chat_id, msg, &params)` | `EditCaptionParams` | 改完的 `Message` |","table":"table-4"},"1771":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                          | 参数结构体             | 返回值           |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------- |\n| `edit_message_media(chat_id, msg, &params)` | `EditMediaParams` | 改完的 `Message` |","table":"table-4"},"1772":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                                           | 参数结构体 | 返回值           |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------ | ----- | ------------- |\n| `edit_message_reply_markup(chat_id, msg, &rows, timeout_ms)` | —     | 改完的 `Message` |","table":"table-4"},"1773":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                                 | 参数结构体 | 返回值  |\n| -------------------------------------------------- | ----- | ---- |\n| `delete_message(chat_id, ids, revoke, timeout_ms)` | —     | `()` |","table":"table-4"},"1774":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                                              | 参数结构体 | 返回值  |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------- | ----- | ---- |\n| `answer_callback_query(query_id, text, show_alert, timeout_ms)` | —     | `()` |","table":"table-4"},"1775":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'EditTextParams.text': { description: '新文本；None 就是「只改键盘」。', type: 'Option<Text>', default: 'None',…\" />"},"1776":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"`delete_message` 的 `revoke = true` 表示对所有人撤回；`answer_callback_query` 的 `text` 是 `None` 就发空串\n（`url` / `cache_time` 固定 `\"\"` / `0`）。点了内联按钮之后**必须**应答，否则客户端一直转圈。"},"1777":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#6-内联键盘replybutton","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ text: { description: '按钮文案。', type: 'String', required: true }, action: { description: '点下去做什么：Cal…\" />"},"1778":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#6-内联键盘replybutton","content":"构造：`ReplyButton::callback(text, data)` / `url` / `user` / `web_app`，再 `.emoji(id)` / `.style(..)`。"},"1779":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"`command_of(update)` 从一条 `updateNewMessage` 里认出命令（只认文本消息，**跳过自己发的**）；\n`on_command(host, handler)` 一次性订阅，`CommandSubscription` **drop 即退订**——把它存进插件状态。\nuser 账户自己触发的 `.cmd` 由宿主**先归一化成 `/cmd`、把 `is_outgoing` 抹平**再交给插件，\n所以插件看到的仍然是普通的 `/cmd` 更新。"},"1780":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"**点名给别人的命令不会送到 `handler`。** Telegram 的约定是：裸命令（`/start`）所有 bot 都响应，\n带 `@` 的只有被点名的那一方响应。`on_command` 按这条规则过滤，所以插件里不用自己再判断 `@`：\n`/start@别的Bot` 根本到不了你手上。判据来自宿主预置的 `fuyubot.host.identity` 服务：登录时由\n`getMe` 写入，之后每条 `updateUser` 都跟着刷新，所以改用户名之后不会按旧名字判断。\n遇到点名命令时**现问一次**（纯内存读，不是 TDLib 请求，不会卡接收循环）。"},"1781":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ chat_id: { description: '命令所在的会话。', type: 'i64' }, message_id: { description: '这条消息本身（回复 / 编辑直接用它）…\" />"},"1782":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"要看「点名给别人的」那种消息，就别走 `on_command`——自己订阅原始更新\n`host.on(\"updateNewMessage\", None, …)`，再配 `command_of` 解析。判定规则本身也是公开的：\n`command.addressed_to`（`@` 后面的名字）、`command.is_addressed_to(\"FuyuBot\")`、\n`command.is_for(&usernames)`；`my_usernames(&host)` 就是问宿主「我是谁」。"},"1783":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"**没登录 / `--no-tdlib` / `--replay` 时身份未知**，这时 `on_command` 不过滤——分不清\n「点名的是别人」还是「我还不知道自己是谁」，宁可多回一句也不吞命令。"},"1784":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#回复命令交给宿主决定发消息还是编辑","content":"命令回复**不要自己拼 `sendMessage`**。用 `Command::reply`（阻塞）或\n`Command::reply_then`（回调）：入参与 `send_message` 一样，是一个\n`SendMessageParams`（文本 / 媒体、`reply_markup`、`link_preview`、`topic_id`、`timeout_ms`），\n`reply_to_message_id` 会被宿主覆盖成这条命令。"},"1785":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#回复命令交给宿主决定发消息还是编辑","content":"宿主按账号类型和触发者决定怎么回："},"1786":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#回复命令交给宿主决定发消息还是编辑","content":"| 场景                                                | 宿主实际发的方法                                                                                  |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| bot 账户 + **非私聊** + 命令带 `ephemeral_message_id > 0` | `sendEphemeralMessage` + `inputMessageReplyToEphemeralMessage`；`receiver_user_id` = 命令发送者 |","table":"table-5"},"1787":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#回复命令交给宿主决定发消息还是编辑","content":"| 场景                                 | 宿主实际发的方法                                  |\n| ---------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| bot 账户（其余情况）；或 user 账户里**白名单用户**触发 | `sendMessage` + `reply_to` 原命令（和以前一样发新消息） |","table":"table-5"},"1788":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-96","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#回复命令交给宿主决定发消息还是编辑","content":"| 场景              | 宿主实际发的方法                                            |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| user 账户**自己**触发 | 编辑原命令消息：文本 `editMessageText`，富媒体 `editMessageMedia` |","table":"table-5"},"1789":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-97","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#回复命令交给宿主决定发消息还是编辑","content":"`sendEphemeralMessage` 的三个条件必须同时满足：命令消息的 `ephemeral_message_id > 0`、\n当前登录账号是 **bot**（`getMe` 的 `userTypeBot`，不用配置兜底）、**不是私聊**\n（私聊 id 为正，群/频道为负）。任一不满足就退回普通消息 / 编辑，**不会尝试 ephemeral**；\n退回普通消息时也**不会 `reply_to` 那条 ephemeral 命令**（TDLib 不允许普通消息回复 ephemeral 消息）。"},"1790":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-98","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#回复命令交给宿主决定发消息还是编辑","content":"成功时 `reply` / `reply_then` 拿到的是 TDLib 的**最终 `Message`**（与 `send_message` 一致），\n不再有 `method` / `edited` 之类的包装字段。失败是 `SimplifyError`（服务侧对应\n`{\"@type\":\"error\",…}`）。"},"1791":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-99","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#回复命令交给宿主决定发消息还是编辑","content":"`fuyubot.host.command` 的 `reply` 是**同步阻塞**的：插件在命令回调（接收循环线程）里\n必须用 `Command::reply_then`，否则会卡死自己。`reply_then` 返回的句柄要在 `stop()` 里\njoin 掉——插件是动态库，卸载后线程不能再跑库里的代码。"},"1792":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-100","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"发送类方法等的是**两件事**——响应只是第一截，箭头指的地方才是它真正返回的位置："},"1793":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-101","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"发送类方法的两段时间线"},"1794":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-102","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"send_message 先发请求；收到响应时拿到的是还没发出去的临时消息，再等到发送结局 updateMessageSendSucceeded 或 updateMessageSendFailed 才返回最终 Message；超时则先撤回那条没发出去的消息再返回 Timeout。"},"1795":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-103","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"时间去向右"},"1796":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-104","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"① 发出请求"},"1797":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-105","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"td_invoke sendMessage"},"1798":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-106","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"② 收到响应"},"1799":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-107","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"临时消息，还没发出去"},"1800":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-108","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"③ 收到结局"},"1801":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-109","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"Succeeded / Failed"},"1802":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-110","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"send_message 在这里返回"},"1803":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-111","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"最终 Message"},"1804":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-112","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"超时：先撤回那条没发出去的"},"1805":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-113","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"deleteMessages(revoke) → Timeout"},"1806":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-114","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"两步之间按临时消息的 `old_message_id` 精确对号；其余方法（`edit_*` / `delete_message` / `answer_callback_query`）\n只等到 ② 就返回了。想自己接原始 JSON，用下面的 `wait_response` / `wait_for_update`。"},"1807":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-115","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'UpdateFilter::new(type)': { description: '按「消息包在 message 里」的更新类型过滤，例如 updateNewMessage。', type: '…\" />"},"1808":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-116","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"三条提醒：等待靠**更新投递**；`UpdateFilter::to_json()` 里的 `update_type` 是**通道选择**\n（`event_type` 键），不参与负载匹配——详见订阅与事件。"},"1809":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-117","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#81-缓存优先的对象读取","content":"`Simplify` 的 chat / user / 群 / 社区 / 成员读取默认走宿主缓存\n（`[cache]`，见TDLib 对象缓存）："},"1810":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-118","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#81-缓存优先的对象读取","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'chat(chat_id, timeout_ms)': { description: '缓存优先；返回完整 Chat（含 positions / chat_lists）。未命中且离线时直接 No…\" />"},"1811":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-119","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#81-缓存优先的对象读取","content":"列表条目只带 `chat_id / order / is_pinned / title / type`；需要完整对象时再调 `chat()`。\n完整 Chat 永远包含完整的 `positions` / `chat_lists`，不会拿列表条目顶替。"},"1812":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-120","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#9-实体与下载","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'resolve_entities(ids, timeout_ms)': { description: '并发发 getChat / getUser，再逐个收齐 → EntitiesResolut…\" />"},"1813":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-121","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#9-实体与下载","content":"想看实时进度又不想阻塞，就去订阅原始的 `updateFile`——原始更新一直可见，不与简化事件冲突。"},"1814":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-122","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#10-富消息","content":"一套独立的参数类型（`RichMessageParams`），是因为它跟「文本 + 媒体」的互斥规则完全不同\n（那边二选一，这边是块树）。API 见富消息，本文不重复。"},"1815":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-123","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"TDLib 里 `user` **连 `is_bot` 都没有**（身份在 `user.type`），管理权也不在任何「用户信息」上——\n它只在 `getChatMember` 给的 `ChatMember.status` 里。"},"1816":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-124","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'is_chat_admin(chat_id, user_id, right, timeout_ms)': { description: '这个用户在这个聊天里有没有管理权。right: None…\" />"},"1817":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-125","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"判定规则（`is_admin_status`）："},"1818":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-126","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"| `status.@type`                | `right: None` | `right: Some(x)`       |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `chatMemberStatusCreator`（群主） | `true`        | `true`——群主拥有一切（唯一例外见下） |","table":"table-6"},"1819":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-127","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"| `status.@type`                  | `right: None` | `right: Some(x)`                             |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `chatMemberStatusAdministrator` | `true`        | `status.rights.<x>` 必须为 `true`，字段缺失按 `false` |","table":"table-6"},"1820":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-128","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"| `status.@type`                                    | `right: None` | `right: Some(x)` |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ---------------- |\n| 其余四种（`member` / `restricted` / `left` / `banned`） | `false`       | `false`          |","table":"table-6"},"1821":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-129","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"⚠️ 群主的**匿名**是 `status.is_anonymous`，不在 `rights` 里——所以 `Some(AdminRight::IsAnonymous)`\n对群主读的是前者。`AdminRight` 共 18 项，名字就是 `chatAdministratorRights` 的字段名\n（`can_manage_chat` / `can_delete_messages` / `can_pin_messages` / …），认不出的字段名\n`AdminRight::from_key` 返回 `None`。"},"1822":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-130","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"拿不到成员信息（超时 / TDLib 报错 / 不是群聊）一律 `false`：**不确定时说「没有」比说「有」安全**。"},"1823":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-131","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"`simplify.forward_messages(chat_id, from_chat_id, &params)` → `Result<Vec<Value>>`。"},"1824":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-132","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ message_ids: { description: '要转发的消息 id。**会排序去重**——TDLib 要求严格递增、最多 100 条。', type: 'Vec<i64>', requi…\" />"},"1825":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-133","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"走的是 `forwardMessages`（一次一组，**不是** Bot API 的 `forwardMessage`）。返回的是**还没发完**的临时消息\n——这里只等**响应**，不等发送结局，最终消息照旧经 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` / `updateMessageSendFailed`\n回来。单项没转发成功时 TDLib 在对应位置放 `null`，所以数组长度与排序后的 `message_ids` 一致、\n但元素可能是 `Null`。"},"1826":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-134","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"空列表 → `SimplifyError::EmptyForward`，超过 100 条 → `TooManyForward`，两者都在发请求**之前**挡掉。"},"1827":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-135","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"bot 与用户号**不是同一个方法**，这一点没有「通用写法」可言："},"1828":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-136","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"| 方法                                                   | 用哪个 TDLib 方法                                                 | 语义    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ----- |\n| `react(chat_id, msg, &reaction, is_big, timeout_ms)` | **自动**：bot → `setMessageReactions`，用户 → `addMessageReaction` | 加一个反应 |","table":"table-7"},"1829":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-137","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"| 方法                                             | 用哪个 TDLib 方法                                                         | 语义   |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---- |\n| `unreact(chat_id, msg, &reaction, timeout_ms)` | **自动**：bot → `setMessageReactions` 传空列表，用户 → `removeMessageReaction` | 去掉反应 |","table":"table-7"},"1830":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-138","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"| 方法                 | 用哪个 TDLib 方法            | 语义                  |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `add_reaction(..)` | 固定 `addMessageReaction` | 已知自己是用户号时省掉 `getMe` |","table":"table-7"},"1831":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-139","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"| 方法                  | 用哪个 TDLib 方法             | 语义                   |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------ | -------------------- |\n| `set_reactions(..)` | 固定 `setMessageReactions` | 已知自己是 bot 时；空切片 = 清空 |","table":"table-7"},"1832":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-140","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"自动判定靠 `getMe` 的 `user.type.@type == \"userTypeBot\"`，也就是说 `react` / `unreact` 每次会多一次\n`getMe` 往返（它不碰服务器，TDLib 本地应答）。⚠️ bot 侧没有「删一个」的说法，只能整组覆盖——\n所以 **bot 的 `unreact` 会忽略 `reaction` 参数**，直接清空。"},"1833":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-141","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"`Reaction::emoji(\"👍\")` → `reactionTypeEmoji`；`Reaction::custom_emoji(id)` → `reactionTypeCustomEmoji`。\n付费反应（`reactionTypePaid`）不在这套里。"},"1834":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-142","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"TDLib **没有** `getConnectionState`——连接状态只以 `updateConnectionState` 的形式出现，\n所以「现在连上了吗」只能自己订阅并记住最新那条。"},"1835":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-143","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'track_connection_state()': { description: '订阅并记住最新一条 updateConnectionState → ConnectionTracker（dr…\" />"},"1836":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-144","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"两个坑："},"1837":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-145","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"**订阅之前推过的更新补不回来**（TDLib 的状态更新不重放），所以在插件 `start` 里尽早调；\n晚订阅只会漏掉开头的 `Connecting` / `Updating`。"},"1838":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-146","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"这是**连接**状态（到 Telegram 的链路），**不是**授权状态（`updateAuthorizationState`，登录那一套）。\n两者独立：`connectionStateReady` 也可能还没登录。"},"1839":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-147","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"纯函数，随手支配——想绕过某些方法的等待语义、自己拼请求时尤其有用："},"1840":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-148","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                                                                       | 作用                          |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------- |\n| `send_params` / `album_params` / `edit_text_params` / `edit_caption_params` / `edit_media_params` / `edit_markup_params` | 组装参数（**不含 `@type`**，那是宿主补的） |","table":"table-8"},"1841":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-149","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                                        | 作用                                                    |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `chat_member_params(chat_id, user_id)` / `forward_params(chat_id, from_chat_id, &params)` | 管理权 / 转发的参数（含 `MessageTopic` 与 `MessageSender` 的嵌套形状） |","table":"table-8"},"1842":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-150","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                    | 作用                           |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `reaction_params` / `set_reactions_params` / `remove_reaction_params` | 三种反应请求的参数（user 分支与 bot 分支分开） |","table":"table-8"},"1843":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-151","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                | 作用                                 |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `is_admin_status(&status, right)` | 判一份 `ChatMemberStatus` 有没有管理权，不发请求 |","table":"table-8"},"1844":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-152","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                             | 作用                         |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| `content_json(&Media, render)` | 媒体 → `InputMessageContent` |","table":"table-8"},"1845":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-153","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                          | 作用                                        |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `parse_text_request(&Text)` | `parseTextEntities` 的请求；`Plain` 返回 `None` |","table":"table-8"},"1846":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-154","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                | 作用                            |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `formatted_from(&Text, Option<&Value>)` / `is_formatted_text(..)` | 响应 → `formattedText`；拿不到退回纯文本 |","table":"table-8"},"1847":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-155","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                  | 作用                                  |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `plain_text(&Text)` | 纯文本 → `formattedText`（不花往返），也是默认渲染器 |","table":"table-8"},"1848":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-156","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                                                                    | 作用     |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `command_of(&Value)` / `on_command(host, handler)` / `Command::reply` / `Command::reply_then` / `my_usernames(&host)` | 见第 7 节 |","table":"table-8"},"1849":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-157","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"真 `td_api.tl`：`sendMessage chat_id topic_id reply_to options reply_markup input_message_content`\n——**没有** `message_thread_id` / 顶层 `disable_notification` / 顶层 `caption`（那些是 Bot API 的名字）。\n短名字到 TDLib 字段的映射只有一处实现："},"1850":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-158","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                          | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                    |\n| --------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `topic_id: Some(Topic::forum(n))` | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicForum\",\"forum_topic_id\":n}` |","table":"table-9"},"1851":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-159","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                           | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                        |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `topic_id: Some(Topic::thread(n))` | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicThread\",\"message_thread_id\":n}` |","table":"table-9"},"1852":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-160","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段              | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                         |\n| --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reply_to_message_id` | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\":\"inputMessageReplyToMessage\",\"message_id\":…}` |","table":"table-9"},"1853":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-161","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段       | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                      |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reply_markup` | `reply_markup` = `{\"@type\":\"replyMarkupInlineKeyboard\",\"rows\":…}` |","table":"table-9"},"1854":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-162","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                    | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                               |\n| --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `link_preview: Some(false)` | `inputMessageText.link_preview_options.is_disabled = true` |","table":"table-9"},"1855":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-163","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                 | 落到的 TDLib 字段                           |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| `text` / `media.caption` | `formattedText`（经 `parseTextEntities`） |","table":"table-9"},"1856":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-164","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#16-参数名为什么是这几个","content":"| 参数结构体的字段                    | 落到的 TDLib 字段                                                            |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `is_chat_admin` 的 `user_id` | `getChatMember.member_id` = `{\"@type\":\"messageSenderUser\",\"user_id\":…}` |","table":"table-9"},"1857":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-165","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#17-异步版_then","content":"每个等待版都有一个 `*_then`（`send_message_then` / `send_message_album_then` /\n`edit_message_text_then` / `edit_message_caption_then` / `edit_message_media_then` /\n`edit_message_reply_markup_then` / `delete_message_then` / `answer_callback_query_then` /\n`forward_messages_then` / `react_then` / `unreact_then`）：\n把等待挪到另一个线程，**立刻返回**，结局交给闭包。"},"1858":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-166","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#17-异步版_then","content":"⚠️ 它们返回那个线程的 `JoinHandle`——**插件要在 `stop()` 里 join 掉**，否则动态库卸载之后线程还在跑库里的代码。"},"1859":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-167","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#18-返回值与错误","content":"方法成功时返回的就是 TDLib 原始 JSON（`Value` / `Vec<Value>` / `()`），没有额外包装。\n带状态的返回类型只有 `EntitiesResolution` / `EntityResult` / `FileDownload` 三个（见第 9 节）。"},"1860":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-168","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#18-返回值与错误","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'SimplifyError::Abi': { description: 'ABI 层出错（宿主没接 TDLib、请求号无效等）。', type: 'AbiError' }, 'SimplifyE…\" />"},"1861":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-169","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#18-返回值与错误","content":"编辑类**刻意不重试**——限流该等多久是调用方的事。"},"1862":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-170","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"封装层额外推的两条事件（不想用就订阅原始 `@type`，两者不冲突）："},"1863":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-171","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"| 事件                  | 谁发                    | 负载                              |\n| ------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `entities_resolved` | `resolve_entities` 末尾 | `EntitiesResolution::to_json()` |","table":"table-10"},"1864":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-172","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"| 事件              | 谁发                                 | 负载                                                                  |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `file_progress` | `download_file` 每收到一条 `updateFile` | `{\"file_id\":…,\"completed\":…,\"downloaded_size\":…,\"expected_size\":…}` |","table":"table-10"},"1865":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-173","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#19-简化事件","content":"便捷封装的方法名 / 字段路径是按真 `td_api.tl` 拼的，离线测试拿 `TdApiSchema::check_request`\n逐条校验过（详见开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的第 10 节）；\nMarkdown → entities 的真库行为另有一条 `-- --ignored` 测试。但「真 Telegram 认不认这些值」\n要真账号才验得了。"},"1866":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"page","content":"插件商店","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store"},"1867":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store","content":"配置索引、在 TUI 里安装 / 换版本 / 回滚插件，以及自己维护一个索引"},"1868":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"配置并打开"},"1869":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#发布一个插件给插件作者","content":"发布一个插件（给插件作者）"},"1870":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"维护一个索引（给商城 / 私有源）"},"1871":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#收录到官方商城","content":"收录到官方商城"},"1872":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"安全与限制"},"1873":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store","content":"商店是 TUI 里的一个页面：拉一份静态 `index.json`（schema 2 的轻索引），搜索、看详情、\n下载、校验、解压、安装、换版本、回滚、卸载。宿主和插件运行时不会联网。"},"1874":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store","content":"不想开面板也可以先在浏览器里逛插件目录页\n（与商店同一份索引，按宿主 ABI / 平台筛选版本）。"},"1875":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"新建项目会在 `fuyubot.toml` 里默认写入官方商店："},"1876":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"想换商店改这一行；删掉或留空则关闭商店。也可以用环境变量临时覆盖（优先级更高）："},"1877":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"然后："},"1878":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"在顶部导航切到「商店」页："},"1879":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"| 按键                | 作用   |\n| ----------------- | ---- |\n| `↑` `↓` / `k` `j` | 选择插件 |","table":"table-0"},"1880":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"| 按键              | 作用  |\n| --------------- | --- |\n| `PgUp` / `PgDn` | 翻页  |","table":"table-0"},"1881":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"| 按键                       | 作用   |\n| ------------------------ | ---- |\n| `Home` / `End` / `g` `G` | 跳到首尾 |","table":"table-0"},"1882":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"| 按键      | 作用                       |\n| ------- | ------------------------ |\n| `Enter` | 安装选中的版本（已装别的版本就是升级 / 降级） |","table":"table-0"},"1883":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"| 按键  | 作用                           |\n| --- | ---------------------------- |\n| `v` | 选历史版本（ABI / 平台不兼容的版本会标红，选不了） |","table":"table-0"},"1884":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"| 按键  | 作用            |\n| --- | ------------- |\n| `b` | 回滚到上一次换版本前的版本 |","table":"table-0"},"1885":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"| 按键  | 作用         |\n| --- | ---------- |\n| `x` | 卸载选中的已安装插件 |","table":"table-0"},"1886":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"| 按键  | 作用                  |\n| --- | ------------------- |\n| `/` | 输入过滤词（id / 名称 / 简介） |","table":"table-0"},"1887":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"| 按键  | 作用    |\n| --- | ----- |\n| `r` | 重新拉索引 |","table":"table-0"},"1888":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"| 按键    | 作用    |\n| ----- | ----- |\n| `Esc` | 返回插件页 |","table":"table-0"},"1889":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"换版本会先把旧目录挪到 `plugins/.backup/<id>/`（脚本插件是\n`plugins/.backup/scripts/<id>/`），新版本落位失败会自动还原；`b` 把备份换回来。\n运行中的实例还持有 DLL，Windows 上必须先停实例：按 `Esc` 回插件页再按 `x`\n（商店页里的 `x` 是卸载，不是停止）。"},"1890":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"安装 / 换版本后需要重启实例（Windows 不能替换已加载的 DLL）。选中已安装的那个版本再按\n`Enter` 只会提示「已经装好了」，不会重复下载。"},"1891":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"商店选版本的规则（低版本宿主不会被迫装高 ABI 的新版本）："},"1892":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"`latest` 未下架、ABI ≤ 本宿主、且有本平台（或 `any`）的包 → 用它；"},"1893":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"否则按版本列表倒序找第一个同样条件的版本；"},"1894":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"都不满足就报原因：需要升级 fuyubot / 没有本平台包 / 全被下架。"},"1895":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"想固定在某个历史版本，按 `v` 选它；想回到换版本之前，按 `b`。"},"1896":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"列表**只显示本机能装的插件**：ABI 比本宿主新的、没有本平台包的、全被下架的都不出现，\n被隐藏的数量显示在列表标题里（`索引 · 7（隐藏 2 个不兼容）`）。这样低版本宿主看到的就是\n真正能跑的那一批，而不是一屏点进去全报错的条目。"},"1897":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#配置并打开","content":"没有配置索引地址时，商店页会显示「未配置」，不影响启动、加载和运行。"},"1898":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#发布一个插件给插件作者","content":"按插件分发包的格式打 zip：根上是 `plugin.json` + `bin/`。"},"1899":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#发布一个插件给插件作者","content":"在插件仓库打 tag `v<版本>`（例如 `v1.2.0`），把各平台的 zip 作为 Release 资产上传。"},"1900":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#发布一个插件给插件作者","content":"资产名与平台对应："},"1901":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#发布一个插件给插件作者","content":"纯脚本插件只需要一个 `-any.zip`。Android 必须单独交叉编译，不能复用 Linux 的 `.so`。"},"1902":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#发布一个插件给插件作者","content":"把插件提交到索引（见下一节），或者直接把索引地址给用户。"},"1903":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"索引是一个静态 JSON，可以放在 GitHub Pages、对象存储或任何支持 HTTPS 的地方。\n**schema 2** 把索引拆成「主文件 + 每插件分片」：主文件只放列表字段，选中插件时再拉\n`plugins/<id>.json` 拿描述和版本表。这样主文件不会随插件数量 / 版本数量膨胀。"},"1904":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"主文件："},"1905":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"`plugins/com.example.weather.json`："},"1906":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"主文件字段："},"1907":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段       | 必填  | 说明                            |\n| -------- | --- | ----------------------------- |\n| `schema` | 是   | 固定 `2`（客户端仍兼容 schema 1 的全量索引） |","table":"table-1"},"1908":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段             | 必填  | 说明                              |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------------- |\n| `plugins[].id` | 是   | 插件 id，必须与分片、包内 `plugin.json` 一致 |","table":"table-1"},"1909":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段               | 必填  | 说明  |\n| ---------------- | --- | --- |\n| `plugins[].name` | 是   | 展示名 |","table":"table-1"},"1910":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段                  | 必填  | 说明        |\n| ------------------- | --- | --------- |\n| `plugins[].summary` | 否   | 列表里的一句话简介 |","table":"table-1"},"1911":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段               | 必填  | 说明                |\n| ---------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugins[].repo` | 否   | 源码仓库，`owner/repo` |","table":"table-1"},"1912":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段               | 必填  | 说明   |\n| ---------------- | --- | ---- |\n| `plugins[].tags` | 否   | 搜索标签 |","table":"table-1"},"1913":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段                 | 必填  | 说明                          |\n| ------------------ | --- | --------------------------- |\n| `plugins[].latest` | 否   | 最新版本号；缺省时取分片里最大的非 yanked 版本 |","table":"table-1"},"1914":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段                 | 必填  | 说明                                    |\n| ------------------ | --- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `plugins[].detail` | 是   | 分片地址，相对索引地址解析，约定为 `plugins/<id>.json` |","table":"table-1"},"1915":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段               | 必填  | 说明                                    |\n| ---------------- | --- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `plugins[].abis` | 否   | 摘要：非 yanked 版本出现过的 ABI（目录页筛选用，客户端可忽略） |","table":"table-1"},"1916":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段                           | 必填  | 说明                                                                                       |\n| ---------------------------- | --- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugins[].platform_min_abi` | 否   | 摘要：平台 → 该平台**可用**版本里最低的 ABI（`0` = 版本没声明 ABI）。商店用它判断本机能不能装，**不兼容的插件不会出现在列表里**；没有这份摘要时宁多勿漏 |","table":"table-1"},"1917":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"分片字段："},"1918":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段       | 必填  | 说明     |\n| -------- | --- | ------ |\n| `schema` | 是   | 固定 `2` |","table":"table-2"},"1919":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段       | 必填  | 说明                                                                           |\n| -------- | --- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin` | 是   | 完整条目：`description` / `license` / `homepage` / `tags` / `latest` / `versions` |","table":"table-2"},"1920":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段                | 必填  | 说明                         |\n| ----------------- | --- | -------------------------- |\n| `plugin.versions` | 是   | **按版本号升序**；客户端从后往前找最新的可用版本 |","table":"table-2"},"1921":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段                   | 必填  | 说明                       |\n| -------------------- | --- | ------------------------ |\n| `versions[].version` | 是   | 版本号，与包内 `plugin.json` 一致 |","table":"table-2"},"1922":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段                  | 必填  | 说明                                                              |\n| ------------------- | --- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `versions[].assets` | 是   | 平台 → 资产；平台键用 `windows-x86_64`、`android-aarc