docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"| 字段                  | 必填  | 说明                 |\n| ------------------- | --- | ------------------ |\n| `versions[].yanked` | 否   | `true` 表示撤回，不会再被选中 |","table":"table-2"},"1930":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"索引本身也要满足："},"1931":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"只通过 HTTPS 提供；主文件不超过 8MB，单个分片不超过 1MB；"},"1932":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"`detail` 只能是相对路径或 `https://`，不许带 `..`、不许明文 http；"},"1933":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"资产 URL 必须直接指向 zip，不能是 HTML 页面或会变的 `latest` 链接；"},"1934":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"每个版本的资产都要有正确的 `sha256`，否则商店会拒绝安装；"},"1935":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"一个 zip 只放一个插件。"},"1936":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#维护一个索引给商城--私有源","content":"> 只认 schema 1 的旧宿主会把 schema 2 索引报成「schema 不支持」；升级宿主即可。\n> 商店会带 `If-None-Match` 复用本地缓存，网络断掉时也能用上一次的列表。"},"1937":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#收录到官方商城","content":"官方索引由 `CatMoeCircle/FuyuBot-plugins` 维护：在 `plugins/<id>.yml` 里填写插件信息、\nRelease tag 和资产名，提交 PR。CI 会下载资产、校验 `plugin.json` / sha256 / 平台 / zip\n安全规则，合并后自动重建索引。"},"1938":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#收录到官方商城","content":"一个条目的写法："},"1939":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#收录到官方商城","content":"`assets` 里写文件名，CI 会拼出 `https://github.com/<repo>/releases/download/<tag>/<文件名>`\n并计算 `sha256`。"},"1940":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"索引地址与资产 URL 只接受 HTTPS（http、`file://` 拒绝）；明细分片允许相对路径，但不许 `..`；"},"1941":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"下载后强制校验 sha256，失败即停止，不会落盘；"},"1942":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"解压时拒绝 `..`、绝对路径、符号链接、大小写冲突、Windows 保留名；"},"1943":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"单包上限 50MB，解压后 200MB，最多 2000 个文件；"},"1944":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#安全与限制","content":"安装先落到 `plugins/.staging/<id>/`，校验通过后才改名到 `plugins/<id>/`\n或 `plugins/scripts/<id>/`；目标已存在时拒绝覆盖。"},"1945":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"page","content":"调用 TDLib","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib"},"1946":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"td_invoke、请求号与 response 通道、便捷封装"},"1947":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号与 response 通道"},"1948":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"方法名以 TDLib 为准"},"1949":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/td